('en', 'CET-4', 'sphere', '/sfɪə/', '球体, 范围', 'n', 'Because the earth spins, it is not a perfect sphere. (因为地球旋转，所以它不是个完完全全的球体。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'widespread', '/\'waɪdspred/', '普遍的，广泛的', 'adj', 'the widespread use of chemicals in agriculture (化学品在农业中的广泛使用)', 2),
