('en', 'CET-4', 'immeasurable', '/ɪ\'meʒ(ə)rəb(ə)l/', '无法估量的', 'adj', 'The refugee problem has now reached immeasurable proportions. (难民问题现在已经到了无法估量的程度。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'contaminate', '/kən\'tæmɪneɪt/', '污染，弄脏', 'v', 'Drinking water supplies are believed to have been contaminated. (据信饮用水已受到污染。)', 2),
