('en', 'CET-4', 'worldwide', '/\'wɜːl(d)waɪd/', '全世界范围地', 'adv', 'His books have sold more than 20 million copies worldwide. (他的书在全世界卖出了两千多万本。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'council', '/\'kaʊnsl/', '议会', 'n', 'the council for civil liberties (公民自由委员会)', 2),
