('en', 'CET-4', 'discourage', '/dɪs\'kʌrɪdʒ/', '使气馁, 阻碍', 'v', 'It may be difficult to do at first. Don\'t let this discourage you. (开始时做起来也许比较困难。不要让这个泄你的气。)', 1),
