('en', 'CET-4', 'proposal', '/prə\'pəʊz(ə)l/', '提议', 'n', 'The president is to put forward new proposals for resolving the country\'s constitutional crisis. (总统将提出解决国家宪法危机的新议案。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'combination', '/kɒmbɪ\'neɪʃ(ə)n/', '联合，结合', 'n', 'a combination nightclub and café (夜总会兼咖啡馆)', 1),
('en', 'CET-4', 'promotional', '/prə\'məʊʃənl/', '促销的', 'adj', '"Jeans," according to one company\'s promotional material, "are designed and made to be worn hard." (根据一家公司促销材料上所说的，“牛仔裤为耐穿而设计和制作。”)', 2),
