('en', 'CET-4', 'irregular', '/ɪ\'regjʊlə/', '不规律的', 'adj', 'a jagged, irregular coastline (锯齿状不规则的海岸线)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'incidence', '/\'ɪnsɪd(ə)ns/', '几率，发生率', 'n', 'The incidence of breast cancer increases with age. (乳腺癌的发病率随着年龄的增长而上升。)', 1),
