('en', 'CET-4', 'recycle', '/riː\'saɪk(ə)l/', '循环，再利用', 'v', 'We take all our bottles to be recycled. (我们把我们所有的瓶子都回收利用。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'inquire', '/ɪn\'kwaɪə/', '询问', 'v', '‘Why are you doing that?’ the boy inquired. (“你为什么这么做？”男孩问道。)', 1),
