('en', 'CET-4', 'preferentially', '/,prefə\'renʃəli/', '优先地', 'adv', 'Heterosexuals should not be treated preferentially when the state carries out that role. (当国家执行这个作用的时候不应该优先对待异性恋者。)', 2),
