('en', 'CET-4', 'hit', '/hɪt/', '成功, 打击', 'n', 'First a house took a direct hit and then the rocket exploded. (首先一幢房子被直接击中，接着火箭弹爆炸了。)', 1),
('en', 'CET-4', 'crucial', '/\'kruːʃ(ə)l/', '至关重要的', 'adj', 'The conservation of tropical forests is of crucial importance . (保护热带雨林至关重要。)', 2),
