('en', 'CET-4', 'element', '/\'elɪm(ə)nt/', '元素，要素', 'n', 'Business and management elements are built into the course. (本课程加入了商务和管理方面的内容。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'interpretation', '/ɪn\'tɜːprɪ\'teʃən/', '阐释，说明', 'n', 'One possible interpretation is that they want you to resign. (一种可能的解释是，他们想要你辞职。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'accustom', '/ə\'kʌstəm/', '使习惯', 'v', 'She tried to accustom herself to the tight bandages. (她尝试着使自己习惯那些紧绷的绷带。)', 2),
