('en', 'CET-4', 'reserve', '/rɪ\'zɜːv/', '留出，预定', 'v', 'Do you have to reserve tickets in advance? (你必须预先订票吗？)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'penalty', '/\'pen(ə)ltɪ/', '惩罚', 'n', 'No littering. Penalty $500. (禁止乱扔垃圾。 违者罚款500美元。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'logically', '/\'lɑdʒɪkli/', '合乎情理地，符合逻辑地', 'adv', NULL, 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'abundant', '/ə\'bʌndənt/', '大量的，丰富的', 'adj', 'an abundant supply of fresh water (充足的淡水供应)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'overstate', '/əʊvə\'steɪt/', '夸张，夸大', 'v', 'To say that all motorists speed in residential areas is overstating the case. (说所有驾驶员都在住宅区内超速行驶是言过其实了。)', 1),
