('en', 'CET-4', 'theory', '/\'θɪərɪ/', '理论', 'n', 'Freudian theory has had a great influence on psychology. (弗洛伊德理论对心理学产生过巨大影响。)', 1),
('en', 'CET-4', 'protest', '/\'prəʊtest/', '抗议', 'v', '‘I don’t see why I should take the blame for this!’ she protested. (“我不明白为什么我要对此承担责任！”她抗议道。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'reject', '/rɪ\'dʒekt/', '拒绝，驳回', 'v', 'Sarah rejected her brother’s offer of help. (萨拉拒绝了她弟弟的帮助。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'flaw', '/flɔː/', '缺点，错误', 'n', 'A design flaw (= a mistake or weakness in the way something was made ) caused the engine to explode. (一个设计缺陷导致了引擎爆炸。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'seemingly', '/\'siːmɪŋlɪ/', '表面上看', 'adv', 'seemingly unrelated bits of information (似乎互不相关的零星信息)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'objection', '/əb\'dʒekʃ(ə)n/', '反对', 'n', 'Her objection was that he was too young. (她反对的理由是他太小。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'fancy', '/\'fænsɪ/', '华丽的，别致的', 'adj', 'Harry took me to a fancy restaurant for our anniversary. (哈里带我去了一家豪华餐厅，庆祝我们的结婚纪念日。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'hub', '/hʌb/', '中心', 'n', 'the commercial hub of the region (该地区的商业中心)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'incomparable', '/ɪn\'kɒmp(ə)rəb(ə)l/', '无比的，无可匹敌的', 'adj', 'an incomparable view of San Marco (圣马科美妙绝伦的景色)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'incentive', '/ɪn\'sentɪv/', '动机，刺激', 'n', 'As an added incentive, there’s a bottle of champagne for the best team. (给最优秀的队发一瓶香槟作为额外的鼓励。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'startup', '/stɑ:tʌp/', '启动，开办', 'n', 'You should see something like  Figure 3 after startup. (启动后，您应该看到类似于  图 3 的画面。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'reproduce', '/riːprə\'djuːs/', '复制, 再生', 'v', 'Klimt’s artwork is reproduced in this exquisite book. (这本精美的书里翻印了克里木特的艺术作品。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'distinct', '/dɪ\'stɪŋ(k)t/', '明显的；有区别的', 'adj', 'two entirely distinct languages (两种完全不同的语言)', 1),
('en', 'CET-4', 'stake', '/steɪk/', '风险', 'n', 'They have to win the contract – thousands of jobs are at stake. (他们必须拿下这份合同，这关系到数千个工作岗位。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'moral', '/\'mɒr(ə)l/', '精神上的, 道德的', 'adj', 'It is easy to have an opinion on a moral issue like the death penalty for murder. (对于判谋杀犯死刑这种涉及伦理道德的问题，有个观点并非难事。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'opponent', '/ə\'pəʊnənt/', '对手', 'n', 'Graf’s opponent in today’s final will be Sukova. (格拉芙今天的决赛对手将是苏科娃。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'explicitly', '/ɪk\'splɪsɪtli/', '直接地，明确地', 'adv', 'You have to grant us control explicitly. (你们必须允许我们明确地控制。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'rival', '/\'raɪvl/', '对手', 'n', 'This gives the company a competitive advantage over its rivals. (这使该公司与其对手相比具有一项竞争优势。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'confrontation', '/,kɒnfrʌn\'teɪʃn/', '冲突，对抗', 'n', 'She had stayed in her room to avoid another confrontation. (她待在自己的房间里，以避免再次发生冲突。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'stale', '/steɪl/', '乏味的，没有新意的', 'adj', 'French bread goes stale (= becomes stale ) very quickly. (法式面包极易变味。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'reinforce', '/riːɪn\'fɔːs/', '加强，强化', 'v', 'The film reinforces the idea that women should be pretty and dumb. (这部影片强化了这个观点——女人要漂亮，而且要笨一些。)', 1),
('en', 'CET-4', 'ring', '/rɪŋ/', '拳击台', 'n', NULL, 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'attendance', '/ə\'tend(ə)ns/', '出席，到场', 'n', 'We have an average attendance of 4,000 fans per game. (每场比赛平均有4,000名球迷来观战。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'flow', '/fləʊ/', '流动', 'n&v', 'a new road system to improve traffic flow through the city centre (疏导市中心车流的新道路系统)', 1),
('en', 'CET-4', 'mood', '/muːd/', '心情', 'n', 'You’re in a good mood this morning! (你今天早晨心情不错啊！)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'mutually', '/ˈmjuːtʃuəli/', '互相地', 'adv', 'Note that different users of the system have different goals, and that these goals are often mutually exclusive. (请注意系统的不同用户有不同的目标，而且这些目标经常是相互排斥的。)', 1),
('en', 'CET-4', 'review', '/rɪ\'vjuː/', '回顾；复习', 'n&v', 'a journalist who will review the events of the past six months (将对过去六个月里所发生的事件进行回顾的记者)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'elegant', '/\'elɪg(ə)nt/', '优雅的', 'adj', 'a tall, elegant young woman (身材高挑、举止优雅的年轻女子)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'hospitable', '/hɑ\'spɪtəbl/', '热情友好的', 'adj', 'The local people were very kind and hospitable. (当地人非常友好热情。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'constitute', '/\'kɒnstɪtjuːt/', '组成', 'v', 'We must redefine what constitutes a family. (我们必须对家庭的构成重新定义。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'programmer', '/\'prəʊgræmə/', '程序设计员', 'n', 'The computer programmer botched (up) the job and had to start over. (计算机程序设计员把文件弄坏了，只好重做。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'sophisticated', '/sə\'fɪstɪkeɪtɪd/', '复杂的；世故的', 'adj', 'sophisticated software (很先进的软件)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'ignorant', '/\'ɪgn(ə)r(ə)nt/', '无知的', 'adj', 'an ignorant and uneducated man (不学无术的人)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'imitate', '/\'ɪmɪteɪt/', '模仿', 'v', 'She was a splendid mimic and loved to imitate Winston Churchill. (她是个出色的模仿者，喜欢模仿温斯顿·丘吉尔。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'trigger', '/\'trɪgə/', '引发，引起', 'v', 'The assassination triggered off a wave of rioting. (这次暗杀事件引发了一阵骚乱。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'code', '/kəʊd/', '代码，密码', 'n', 'The spy sent his message in code. (这个间谍用密码发送情报。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'investigate', '/ɪn\'vestɪgeɪt/', '调查', 'v', 'The state police are investigating the incident. (州警察正调查此事。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'outgoing', '/\'aʊtgəʊɪŋ/', '开朗的；外出的', 'adj', 'We’re looking for someone with an outgoing personality. (我们在找一个性格外向的人。)', 1),
('en', 'CET-4', 'evolution', '/ivəˈluʃən/', '演变，进化', 'n', 'the theory of evolution (进化论)', 1),
('en', 'CET-4', 'resourceful', '/rɪ\'sɔːsfl/', '机智的；资源丰富的', 'adj', 'a woman who is energetic and resourceful (精力充沛且足智多谋的女人)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'myth', '/mɪθ/', '神话', 'n', 'a book of Greek myths (一本关于希腊神话的图书)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'legend', '/\'ledʒ(ə)nd/', '传奇', 'n', 'Local legend has it that (= says that ) the island was the original Garden of Eden. (当地传说这个岛就是伊甸园的原型。)', 1),
('en', 'CET-4', 'philosopher', '/fɪ\'lɒsəfə/', '哲学家', 'n', 'Plato, Aristotle, and other Greek philosophers (柏拉图、亚里士多德和其他希腊哲学家)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'concrete', '/\'kɒŋkriːt/', '具体的', 'adj', 'What does that mean in concrete terms ? (具体来说那到底是什么意思？)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'emerge', '/ɪ\'mɜːdʒ/', '出现', 'v', 'The flowers emerge in the spring. (花儿在春天开放。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'stir', '/stɜː/', '搅动；煽动，激起', 'v', 'Stir the paint to make sure it is smooth. (将油漆搅拌至均匀。)', 1),
('en', 'CET-4', 'senior', '/\'siːnɪə/', '老年人', 'n', 'Seniors can get a 10% discount. (老年人可以享受10%的折扣。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'nutritious', '/njʊ\'trɪʃəs/', '营养的', 'adj', 'Wholemeal bread is more nutritious than white bread. (全麦面包比白面包更有营养。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'expert', '/\'ekspɜːt/', '熟练的，内行的', 'adj', 'He cast his expert eye on the gardener’s work. (他用内行的眼光看了看园丁干的活。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'carpenter', '/ˈkɑːpəntə(r)/', '木匠', 'n', 'He is a carpenter by profession. (他以木工为业。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'dampen', '/\'dæmp(ə)n/', '抑制', 'v', 'The light rain dampened the crowd’s enthusiasm. (小雨使观众的热情减退了。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'grant', '/grɑːnt/', '授予；允许', 'v', 'France has agreed to grant him political asylum. (法国已经同意给予他政治庇护。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'security', '/sɪ\'kjʊərətɪ/', '安全，安保', 'n', 'The trial was held under tight security . (这场审讯是在戒备森严的情况下进行的。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'steep', '/stiːp/', '急剧升/降的；陡峭的', 'adj', 'The road became rocky and steep. (路变得崎岖陡峭起来。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'implementation', '/ɪmplɪmen\'teɪʃ(ə)n/', '实现，履行', 'n', 'They do, however, greatly affect the implementation of those patterns.  (然而，它们的确对那些模式的 实现影响很大。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'weaken', '/\'wiːk(ə)n/', '减少，减弱', 'v', 'Over the last two years the president’s position has weakened. (过去两年来，总统的地位被削弱了。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'puzzle', '/\'pʌz(ə)l/', '迷惑', 'n&v', 'My sister puzzles me and causes me anxiety. (我的妹妹常会让我不解，使我焦虑。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'memorize', '/\'meməraɪz/', '熟记，牢记', 'v', 'He studied his map, trying to memorize the way to Rose\'s street. (他研究了地图，努力记住去罗丝家那条街的路。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'cater', '/\'keɪtə/', '迎合', 'v', 'We cater to an exclusive clientele. (我们满足一个特殊客户群的需求。)', 2);
