('en', 'CET-4', 'acceleration', '/əkselə\'reɪʃ(ə)n/', '加速；加速度', 'n', 'The latest model has excellent acceleration. (这款最新型号加速性能优异。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'accent', '/\'æks(ə)nt; -sent/', '口音，腔调；重音', 'n', 'He had a strong Irish accent (他有浓重的爱尔兰口音。)', 2),
