('en', 'CET-4', 'acceptance', '/ək\'sept(ə)ns/', '接受，验收；承认', 'n', 'He wrote a letter of acceptance (=  a letter in which you agree to accept a job, university place etc  ) to the university. (他给那所大学写了一封接受函。)', 2),
