('en', 'CET-4', 'cucumber', '/\'kjuːkʌmbə/', '黄瓜', 'n', 'The "gurkophone" is one of their classics, made from a hollowed cucumber, a pepper and a carrot. (黄瓜管"是他们的经典乐器之一,那是用掏空的黄瓜、辣椒和胡萝卜做的。)', 1),
