('en', 'CET-4', 'culture', '/\'kʌltʃə/', '文化，文明；教养', 'n', 'We speak Danish at home so that the boys don’t lose touch with their language and culture. (我们在家说丹麦语，这样男孩子们就不会脱离他们的语言和文化。)', 1),
