('en', 'CET-4', 'cupboard', '/\'kʌbəd/', '碗柜，碗碟橱；食橱', 'n', 'It’s in the kitchen cupboard. (它在厨房的碗柜里。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'cure', '/kjʊə; kjɔː/', '医治；消除；治愈', 'v', 'She had some acupuncture treatment which seems to have cured her. (她接受了某种针刺疗法，好像把她的病治好了。)', 2),
