('en', 'CET-4', 'curious', '/\'kjʊərɪəs/', '好奇的；稀奇古怪的', 'adj', 'Puppies are naturally curious. (小狗天生好奇。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'curl', '/kɜːl/', '卷毛；螺旋；卷曲', 'n', 'Use a diffuser to maximise the volume and curl of your hair. (使用电吹风罩把头发吹得蓬松卷曲。)', 1),
