('en', 'CET-4', 'custom', '/\'kʌstəm/', '习惯，风俗；海关', 'n', 'He awoke early, as was his custom. (他很早醒来，这是他的习惯。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'customer', '/\'kʌstəmə/', '顾客，主顾', 'n', 'We aim to offer good value and service to all our customers. (我们力求为所有的客户提供物有所值的商品和服务。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'cut', '/kʌt/', '切，割，剪；减少', 'v', 'They’re introducing CCTV cameras in an attempt to cut street crime in the area. (为了减少该地区的街头犯罪，他们安装了闭路电视摄像机。)', 1),
