('en', 'CET-4', 'damp', '/dæmp/', '潮湿的，有湿气的', 'adj', 'Wipe the leather with a damp cloth. (用湿布擦拭皮面。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'dance', '/dɑːns/', '跳舞；摇晃；舞', 'v', 'Come on, let’s dance. (来吧，我们跳舞吧。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'danger', '/\'deɪn(d)ʒə/', '危险；危险事物', 'n', 'Danger! No boats beyond this point. (危险！船只不可越过此处。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'dangerous', '/\'deɪn(d)ʒ(ə)rəs/', '危险的，不安全的', 'adj', 'laws about dangerous dogs (有关危险犬类的法律)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'dare', '/deə/', 'v敢；竟敢', 'vt&aux', 'He wanted to ask her, but he didn’t dare. (他想问她，但又不敢。)', 3),
