('en', 'CET-4', 'deal', '/diːl/', '买卖；待遇；给予', 'n', 'The prime minister promised farmers a new deal (= a new and fairer system ) . (首相向农民保证推行一项新政策。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'dear', '/dɪə/', '亲爱的；啊', 'adj', 'Dear Sir or Madam, ... (尊敬的先生或女士，…)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'death', '/deθ/', '死，死亡；灭亡', 'n', '1.5 million people are in immediate danger of death from starvation. (150万人正因饥饿而即将面临死亡的危险。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'debate', '/dɪ\'beɪt/', '争论，辩论', 'n&vi', 'the gun-control debate in the US (美国有关控制枪支的争论)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'debt', '/det/', '债，债务，欠债', 'n', 'He had enough money to pay off his outstanding debts. (他有足够的钱偿还亏欠的债务。)', 2),
