('en', 'CET-4', 'decision', '/dɪ\'sɪʒ(ə)n/', '决定，决心；果断', 'n', 'Do you ever wonder if you made the right decision? (你怀疑过自己所作的决定是否正确吗？)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'deck', '/dek/', '甲板；舱面；层面', 'n', 'Eddie returned to the flight deck (= the part of an aircraft where the pilot sits ) . (埃迪回到了驾驶舱。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'declare', '/dɪ\'kleə/', '断言；声明；表明', 'v', 'A state of emergency has been declared. (已宣布进入紧急状态。)', 2),
