('en', 'CET-4', 'deduce', '/dɪ\'djuːs/', '演绎，推论，推断', 'v', 'Alison cleverly deduced that I was the author of the letter. (艾莉森聪明地推断出我是这封信的作者。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'deed', '/diːd/', '行为；功绩；契约', 'n', 'After the morning’s good deeds he deserved a rest. (上午做了好事之后，他理应休息一下。)', 1),
