('en', 'CET-4', 'fisherman', '/\'fɪʃəmən/', '渔民，渔夫，打鱼人', 'n', 'The Algarve is a paradise for fishermen whether river anglers or deep-sea fishermen. (阿尔加维对河边的垂钓者或深海的渔民都是一个天堂。)', 2),
