('en', 'CET-4', 'insist', '/ɪn\'sɪst/', '坚持；坚持要求', 'v', 'Stay for supper – I insist! (留下来吃晚餐——一定的！)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'inspect', '/ɪn\'spekt/', '检查，审查；检阅', 'v', 'I got out of the car to inspect the damage. (我下车查看损坏情况。)', 3),
