('en', 'CET-4', 'inspire', '/ɪn\'spaɪə/', '鼓舞；给…以灵感', 'v', 'We need someone who can inspire the team. (我们需要一个能鼓舞团队士气的人。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'install', '/ɪnˈstɔ:l/', '安装，设置', 'v', 'They’ve installed the new computer network at last. (他们终于安装了新电脑网络。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'installation', '/ɪnstə\'leɪʃ(ə)n/', '安装；装置；设施', 'n', 'the installation and maintenance of alarm systems (警报系统的安装和维护)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'instance', '/\'ɪnst(ə)ns/', '例子，实例，事例', 'n', 'We need to rethink the way we consume energy. Take, for instance, our approach to transport. (我们需要重新考虑我们使用能源的方式，例如我们的运输方式。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'instant', '/\'ɪnst(ə)nt/', '瞬间；立即的', 'n', 'For an instant, Barney was tempted to flee. (那一瞬间，巴尼很想逃走。)', 1),
('en', 'CET-4', 'instantly', '/\'ɪnst(ə)ntlɪ/', '立即，即刻', 'adv', 'All four victims died instantly. (四名受害人全部当即死亡。)', 1),
