('en', 'CET-4', 'interfere', '/ɪntə\'fɪə/', '干涉，干预；妨碍', 'v', 'My daughter-in-law said that I was interfering, but I was only trying to help. (我的儿媳说我多管闲事，但我只是想帮忙。)', 2),
