('en', 'CET-4', 'mistake', '/mɪ\'steɪk/', '错误；误解，弄错', 'n', 'The most common mistake is to plant them too deep. (最常见的错误就是把它们种得太深了。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'Mister', NULL, '先生', 'n', 'Look, Mister, we know our job, so don\'t try to tell us what to do. (哎，先生，我们了解自己的工作，所以你不必告诉我们该干什么。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'mistress', '/\'mɪstrɪs/', '女主人；夫人', 'n', 'The maid looked nervously at her mistress. (女仆紧张地看着女主人。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'misunderstand', '/,mɪsʌndə\'stænd/', '误解，误会，曲解', 'v', 'Rachel, you must have misunderstood her! Ellie would never say something like that. (雷切尔，你一定是误会她了！埃莉绝不会说那样的话。)', 1),
('en', 'CET-4', 'mix', '/mɪks/', '使混合，混淆', 'v', 'Oil and water don’t mix. (油和水不相融。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'mixture', '/\'mɪkstʃə/', '混合；混合物', 'n', 'Pour the mixture into four small dishes. (把混合料倒入四个小碟子里。)', 1),
('en', 'CET-4', 'moan', '/məʊn/', '呻吟声；呻吟', 'n', 'She gave a little moan of pleasure. (她轻轻地发出一声快乐的呻吟。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'mobile', '/ˈməʊbaɪl/', '运动的；流动的', 'adj', 'mobile air-conditioners (移动式空调器)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'mode', '/məʊd/', '方式，样式', 'n', 'Set the monitor to 256 colour mode. (把显示器调成256色彩模式。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'model', '/\'mɒdl/', '模型；模式；模特儿', 'n', 'a working model (= one with parts which move ) of a steam engine (蒸汽机车的活动模型)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'moderate', '/\'mɒd(ə)rət/', '温和的；有节制的', 'adj', 'the more moderate members of the party (党内观点较为温和的党员)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'modern', '/\'mɒd(ə)n/', '现代的，近代的', 'adj', 'Such companies must change if they are to compete in the modern world . (此类公司如果想在现代社会中与别人竞争，就必须有所改变。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'modest', '/\'mɒdɪst/', '有节制的；谦虚的', 'adj', 'You’re too modest! You’ve been a huge help to us. (你太谦虚了！你帮了我们大忙呢。)', 1),
('en', 'CET-4', 'modify', '/\'mɒdɪfaɪ/', '更改，修改；修饰', 'v', 'The feedback will be used to modify the course for next year. (这些反馈意见将用于修改明年的课程。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'moist', '/mɒɪst/', '湿润的；多雨的', 'adj', 'Make sure the soil is moist before planting the seeds. (播种之前要确保土壤湿润。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'moisture', '/\'mɒɪstʃə/', '潮湿，湿气；温度', 'n', 'When the soil is dry, more moisture is lost from the plant. (土壤干燥时，植物就会失去更多的水分。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'molecule', '/\'mɒlɪkjuːl/', '分子，克分子', 'n', 'The molecules of oxygen gas contain just two atoms. (氧分子中只有两个原子。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'moment', '/\'məʊm(ə)nt/', '片刻，瞬间，时刻', 'n', 'It was one of the most exciting moments in his life. (这是他一生中最激动人心的时刻之一。)', 1),
('en', 'CET-4', 'Monday', '/ˈmʌndeɪ; ˈmʌndi/', '星期一', 'n', 'The president announced Monday that he would cancel the debt. (总统周一宣布他会取消这笔债务。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'money', '/\'mʌnɪ/', '货币；金钱，财富', 'n', 'Don’t spend all your money on the first day of your holiday! (别在度假的第一天就把钱都花完了！)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'monitor', '/\'mɒnɪtə/', '班长；监视器', 'n', 'a heart monitor (心脏监测仪)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'monkey', '/\'mʌŋkɪ/', '猴子，猿', 'n', 'The monkey is beating up and down. (那只猴子到处乱窜。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'month', '/mʌnθ/', '月，月份', 'n', 'I hope I’ll have finished the work by the end of the month . (我希望我这个月底能完成工作。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'monthly', '/\'mʌnθlɪ/', '每月的；每月', 'adj', 'The mortgage is payable in monthly instalments. (抵押贷款每月分期偿还。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'monument', '/\'mɒnjʊm(ə)nt/', '纪念碑；纪念馆', 'n', 'He erected a monument on the spot where his daughter was killed. (他在女儿遇难的地方立了块纪念碑。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'mood', '/muːd/', '心情，情绪；语气', 'n', 'You’re in a good mood this morning! (你今天早晨心情不错啊！)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'moon', '/muːn/', '月球，月亮；卫星', 'n', 'the craters on the surface of the moon (月球表面的环形山)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'moral', '/\'mɒr(ə)l/', '道德的；合乎道德的', 'adj', 'It is easy to have an opinion on a moral issue like the death penalty for murder. (对于判谋杀犯死刑这种涉及伦理道德的问题，有个观点并非难事。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'more', '/mɔː/', '更多的；更', 'adj', 'The accident taught him to be more careful. (这起事故的教训使他变得更小心。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'moreover', '/mɔːr\'əʊvə/', '再者，加之，此外', 'adv', 'The rent is reasonable and, moreover, the location is perfect. (租金合理，而且位置也非常好。)', 1),
('en', 'CET-4', 'morning', '/\'mɔːnɪŋ/', '早晨，上午', 'n', 'I hated those cold winter mornings. (我讨厌冬天里寒冷的早晨。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'mortal', '/\'mɔːt(ə)l/', '终有一死的；致死的', 'adj', 'Her father’s death reminded her that she was mortal. (父亲的去世让她认识到终有一天她也会死去。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'mosquito', '/mɒ\'skiːtəʊ/', '蚊子', 'n', 'The male mosquito never stings. (雄蚊不叮。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'most', '/məʊst/', '最多的；最，很', 'adj', 'The president himself won the most votes. (总统本人赢得了最多的选票。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'mostly', '/\'məʊs(t)lɪ/', '主要的，大部分', 'adv', 'Green teas are mostly from China or Japan. (绿茶主要来自中国或日本。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'mother', '/\'mʌðə/', '母亲，妈妈', 'n', 'His mother and father are both doctors. (他的父母都是医生。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'motion', '/\'məʊʃ(ə)n/', '运动；手势；提议', 'n', 'Newton’s first law of motion (牛顿第一运动定律)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'motivate', '/\'məʊtɪveɪt/', '促动；激励，激发', 'v', 'A good teacher has to be able to motivate her students. (好教师必须能够激发学生的积极性。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'motive', '/\'məʊtɪv/', '动机，目的', 'n', 'What do you suppose the killer’s motive was? (你认为凶手的动机是什么？)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'motor', '/\'məʊtə/', '发动机；机动车', 'n', 'an electric motor (电动马达)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'mould', '/məʊld/', '模子，模型；浇铸', 'n', 'Another method, used especially for figures, was to pour the clay into a mould. (另一个方法是把黏土倒入模具中，尤其用于铸造人像。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'mount', '/maʊnt/', '登上，爬上；…山', 'v', 'He mounted his horse and rode on. (他跨上马前行。)', 1),
('en', 'CET-4', 'mountain', '/ˈmaʊntən/', '山，山岳；山脉', 'n', 'the highest mountain in Austria (奥地利最高的山)', 1),
('en', 'CET-4', 'mourn', '/mɔːn/', '哀痛，哀悼', 'v', 'Hundreds of people gathered to mourn the slain president. (成百上千人聚集在一起悼念遇刺的总统。)', 1),
('en', 'CET-4', 'mouse', '/maʊs/', '鼠，耗子', 'n', 'The cat laid a dead mouse at my feet. (猫把一只死老鼠放在我的脚边。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'mouth', '/maʊθ/', '嘴，口，口腔', 'n', 'He lifted his glass to his mouth. (他把玻璃杯举到嘴边。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'mouthful', '/\'maʊθfʊl; -f(ə)l/', '满口，一口，少量', 'n', 'Michael told his story between mouthfuls. (迈克尔边吃边讲他的故事。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'move', '/muːv/', '移动；感动；动', 'v', 'Please keep the doors closed while the train is moving. (火车行驶时请保持车门关闭。)', 1),
('en', 'CET-4', 'movement', '/\'muːvm(ə)nt/', '动作，活动；移动', 'n', 'It\'s part of a broader nationalist movement that\'s gaining strength throughout the country. (这是一场正在全国范围内日益壮大的更为广泛的民族主义运动的一部分。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'movie', '/\'muːvɪ/', '电影；电影院', 'n', 'It was like one of those old John Wayne movies. (这部电影有点像约翰•韦恩演的一部老片子。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'much', '/mʌtʃ/', '非常，很；许多的', 'adv', 'The day ended much as it began. (这一天结束时还像开始时一样。)', 1),
('en', 'CET-4', 'mud', '/mʌd/', '软泥，泥浆', 'n', 'By the end of the game, all the kids were covered in mud. (到了比赛快结束的时候，所有的孩子都浑身是泥。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'muddy', '/\'mʌdɪ/', '多泥的，泥泞的', 'adj', 'Take your boots off outside if they’re muddy. (要是靴子上都是泥，你就脱在门外吧。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'mug', '/mʌg/', '大杯', 'n', 'a coffee mug (一个咖啡杯)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'multiple', '/\'mʌltɪpl/', '复合的；并联的', 'adj', 'Baxter was rushed to the hospital with multiple stab wounds. (巴克斯特因多处刺伤被紧急送往医院。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'multiply', '/\'mʌltɪplaɪ/', '使增加；乘', 'v', 'Children will learn to multiply in the second grade. (儿童在二年级学习乘法。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'murder', '/\'mɜːdə/', '谋杀，凶杀', 'n&vi', 'On the night the murder was committed , he was out of the country. (凶案发生当晚他不在国内。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'murderer', '/\'mɜːd(ə)rə(r)/', '杀人犯，凶手', 'n', 'a convicted murderer (已定罪的谋杀犯)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'muscle', '/\'mʌs(ə)l/', '肌肉，肌；体力', 'n', 'Relax your stomach muscles , then stretch again. (放松腹部肌肉，然后再绷紧。)', 1),
('en', 'CET-4', 'museum', '/mjuː\'zɪəm/', '博物馆；展览馆', 'n', 'the Museum of Modern Art (现代艺术博物馆)', 1),
('en', 'CET-4', 'mushroom', '/\'mʌʃruːm; -rʊm/', '蘑菇，菌类植物', 'n', 'mushroom soup (蘑菇汤)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'music', '/\'mjuːzɪk/', '音乐，乐曲，乐谱', 'n', 'I often listen to classic music when I’m in the car. (我在车上经常听古典音乐。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'musical', '/\'mjuːzɪk(ə)l/', '音乐的；和谐的', 'adj', 'a musical version of the fairy tale ‘Cinderella’ (童话故事《灰姑娘》的音乐剧版)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'musician', '/mjuː\'zɪʃ(ə)n/', '音乐家；作曲家', 'n', 'a talented young musician (有天赋的年轻音乐家)', 1),
('en', 'CET-4', 'must', '/mʌst/', 'aux必须；必然要', 'v', 'All passengers must wear seat belts. (所有乘客都必须系安全带。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'mute', '/mjuːt/', '缄默的；哑巴', 'adj', 'Billy continued to stand there, mute and defiant. (比利还是站在那儿一声不吭，一副不服气的样子。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'mutter', '/\'mʌtə/', '轻声低语；抱怨', 'v', 'Elsie muttered something I couldn’t catch and walked off. (埃尔茜咕哝了一句什么，我也没有听懂，她就走掉了。)', 1),
('en', 'CET-4', 'mutton', '/\'mʌt(ə)n/', '羊肉', 'n', '...a leg of mutton. (…一条羊腿。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'mutual', '/\'mjuːtʃʊəl; -tjʊəl/', '相互的；共同的', 'adj', 'I didn’t like Dev, and the feeling seemed to be mutual. (我不喜欢德夫，他好像也不喜欢我。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'my', '/maɪ/', '我的', 'pron', 'All my friends do not smoke. (我的朋友并不全都吸烟。)', 3);
