('en', 'CET-4', 'mystery', '/ˈmɪstri/', '神秘；神秘的事物', 'n', 'Twenty years after the event, his death remains a mystery . (事情过去二十年了，他的死仍然是个谜。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'nail', '/neɪl/', '钉；指甲；钉', 'n', 'The key was hanging on a nail by the door. (钥匙挂在门边的一颗钉子上。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'naked', '/\'neɪkɪd/', '裸体的；无遮敝的', 'adj', 'The children ran naked through the yard. (孩子们光着身子跑过院子。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'name', '/neɪm/', '名字；名誉；说出', 'n', 'Her name is Mandy Wilson. (她的名字是曼迪•威尔逊。)', 2),
