('en', 'CET-4', 'nation', '/\'neɪʃ(ə)n/', '民族；国家', 'n', 'the President’s radio broadcast to the nation (总统对全国的广播讲话)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'national', '/\'næʃ(ə)n(ə)l/', '民族的；国家的', 'adj', 'Religion matters very much at a national level. (宗教事务在全国都非常重要。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'nationality', '/næʃə\'nælɪtɪ/', '国籍；民族，族', 'n', 'people of the same nationality (同国籍的人)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'native', '/\'neɪtɪv/', '本土的；本地人', 'adj', 'Singapore has many native species of palm. (新加坡有很多土生的棕榈树种。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'natural', '/\'nætʃ(ə)r(ə)l/', '自然界的；天然的', 'adj', 'the study of the natural world  (对自然界的研究)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'naturally', '/\'nætʃ(ə)rəlɪ/', '自然地；天然地', 'adv', 'Naturally, you’ll want to discuss this with your wife. (当然，你一定想和你妻子商量一下这件事。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'nature', '/\'neɪtʃə/', '大自然；本性；性质', 'n', 'We grew up in the countryside, surrounded by the beauties of nature. (我们在乡村长大，周围是美丽的大自然。)', 2),
