('en', 'CET-4', 'necklace', '/\'neklɪs/', '项链，项圈', 'n', '...a diamond necklace and matching earrings. (…一条钻石项链和与之相配的耳环。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'need', '/niːd/', '需要；aux需要', 'v', 'You don’t really need a car. (你其实并不需要一辆车。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'needle', '/\'niːd(ə)l/', '针，缝补，编织针', 'n', 'She carried hypodermic needles and syringes in her bag. (她包里带着皮下注射针和针筒。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'needless', NULL, '不需要的', 'adj', 'The report caused needless anxiety to women who have attended the clinic. (那份报告让去那家诊所就诊过的妇女产生了不必要的忧虑。)', 1),
