('en', 'CET-4', 'problem', '/\'prɒbləm/', '问题；习题，问题', 'n', 'She was older than me, but that wasn’t really a problem. (她比我年长，不过那不算什么问题。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'procedure', '/prə\'siːdʒə/', '程序；手续；过程', 'n', 'On board, we were given the usual talk on safety procedures (= what to do if an accident happens, or to prevent an accident ) . (在飞机上，我们听了例行的飞行安全讲解。)', 1),
('en', 'CET-4', 'proceed', '/prə\'siːd/', '进行；继续进行', 'v', 'Before proceeding further, we must define our terms. (我们必须先定义术语，然后再往下展开。)', 2),
