('en', 'CET-4', 'procession', '/prə\'seʃ(ə)n/', '队伍，行列', 'n', 'They marched in procession to the Capitol building. (他们列队向国会大厦行进。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'produce', '/prə\'djuːs/', '生产；产生；展现', 'v', 'New drugs are producing remarkable results . (新药正在产生显著的效果。)', 1),
('en', 'CET-4', 'product', '/\'prɒdʌkt/', '产品，产物；(乘)积', 'n', 'The London factory assembles the finished product . (伦敦工厂组装成品。)', 1),
('en', 'CET-4', 'production', '/prə\'dʌkʃ(ə)n/', '生产；产品；总产量', 'n', 'That model won\'t go into production before late 2007. (那种型号要到2007年底才会投入生产。)', 2),
