('en', 'CET-4', 'professor', NULL, '教授', 'n', 'The professor improvised a poem in the class. (教授在课堂上即兴创作了一首诗。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'profit', '/\'prɒfɪt/', '益处；利润；得益', 'n', 'The shop’s daily profit is usually around $500. (这家商店每天的利润一般在500美元左右。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'program', '/\'prəʊɡræm/', '节目单；大纲；程序', 'n', 'a word processing program (文字处理程序)', 1),
('en', 'CET-4', 'progress', '/\'prəʊgres/', '前进，进展；进步', 'n', 'We made good progress despite the snow. (尽管下雪，我们的行程还是很顺利。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'progressive', '/prə\'gresɪv/', '进步的；向前进的', 'adj', 'a progressive administration (进步的政府)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'prohibit', '/prə(ʊ)\'hɪbɪt/', '禁止，阻止', 'v', 'Smoking is strictly prohibited inside the factory. (厂区严禁吸烟。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'project', '/prəˈdʒekt; ˈprɒdʒekt/', '方案，工程；伸出', 'n', 'The project aims to provide an analysis of children’s emotions. (该计划旨在对儿童情绪作出分析。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'prominent', '/\'prɒmɪnənt/', '实起的；突出的', 'adj', 'a prominent Russian scientist (杰出的俄罗斯科学家)', 2),
