('en', 'CET-4', 'promote', '/prə\'məʊt/', '促进，发扬；提升', 'v', 'You don\'t have to sacrifice environmental protection to promote economic growth. (你们没有必要牺牲环保来促进经济增长。)', 1),
('en', 'CET-4', 'prompt', '/prɒm(p)t/', '及时的；敦促', 'adj', 'Prompt action must be taken. (必须立即采取行动。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'pronoun', '/\'prəʊnaʊn/', '代名词', 'n', 'Now if we could only figure out the pronoun problem. (现在我们可以解决这个代词问题了。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'pronounce', '/prə\'naʊns/', '发…的音；宣布', 'v', 'How do you pronounce your name? (你的名字怎么念？)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'pronunciation', '/prə,nʌnsɪ\'eɪʃ(ə)n/', '发音，发音法', 'n', 'She gave the word its French pronunciation. (她给出了这个单词的法语发音。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'proof', '/pruːf/', '证据；证明；校样', 'n', 'There is no proof that the document is authentic. (没有证据证明这份文件是真的。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'proper', '/\'prɒpə/', '适合的；合乎体统的', 'adj', 'Everything was in its proper place (= where it should be ) . (每样东西都放在恰当的位置。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'property', '/\'prɒpətɪ/', '财产，资产；性质', 'n', 'The hotel is not responsible for any loss or damage to guests’ personal property . (宾馆对住客个人财物的丢失和损坏概不负责。)', 2);
