('en', 'CET-4', 'controversial', '/ˌkɒntrə\'vɜːʃl/', ' 引起争论的， 有争议的', 'adj', 'the controversial issue of welfare reform (福利改革这一有争议的话题)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'attain', '/ə\'teɪn/', ' 达到， 获得， 完成', 'vt', 'More women are attaining positions of power. (越来越多的女性获得要职。)', 3),
