('en', 'CET-4', 'ambulance', '/\'æmbjələns/', ' 救护车； 野战医院', 'n', 'the ambulance service (救护车服务)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'priority', '/praɪ\'ɒrəti/', ' 优先， 重点； 优先考虑的事', 'n', 'I want to start work on the garden but the house must take priority . (我想开始整修花园，不过还是先得打扫屋子。)', 3),
