('en', 'CET-4', 'standpoint', '/\'stændpɔɪnt/', ' 立场， 观点', 'n', 'a discussion of marriage from the standpoint of women (从女性角度对婚姻的探讨)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'worship', '/\'wɜːʃɪp/', '礼拜；崇拜；信奉； 崇拜', 'n', '...the worship of the ancient Roman gods. (…对古罗马众神的敬奉。)', 2);
