('en', 'CET-4', 'interpretation', '/ɪnˌtɜːprɪ\'teɪʃn/', ' 解释； 口译； 艺术处理', 'n', 'One possible interpretation is that they want you to resign. (一种可能的解释是，他们想要你辞职。)', 1),
('en', 'CET-4', 'ax', '/æks/', ' 斧子', 'n', 'How do you sharpen your ax? (如何磨尖你的斧头呢？)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'intermediate', '/ˌɪntə\'miːdiət/', ' 中间的； 中级的', 'adj', 'an intermediate stage during which the disease is dormant (疾病处于潜伏状态的中期)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'folk', '/fəuk/', ' 人们； 家属， 亲属； 大伙儿， 各位', 'n', 'I’m sure there are some folk who would rather they weren’t here. (我敢肯定有些人宁愿自己不在这里。)', 2),
