('en', 'CET-4', 'competitive', '/kəm\'petətɪv/', ' 竞争的， 比赛的； 好竞争的， 求胜心切的； 有竞争力的', 'adj', 'Some US industries are not as competitive as they have been in the past. (美国有些行业不如以前有竞争力了。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'enquiry', '/ɪn\'kwaɪəri/', ' 询问', 'n', 'We are pleased to receive your enquiry. (我们很高兴收到您的询问函。)', 2),
