('en', 'CET-4', 'abuse', '/ə\'bjuːz/', ' 滥用； 虐待， 伤害； 辱骂， 毁谤； 滥用； 虐待， 伤害； 辱骂， 毁谤', 'vt', 'Williams abused his position as Mayor to give jobs to his friends. (威廉斯滥用市长权力，给不少朋友安排了工作。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'prove', '/pruːv/', ' 证实， 证明； 结果是', 'v', 'You’re wrong, and I can prove it. (你错了，我可以证明。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'scheme', '/skiːm/', ' 密谋， 策划；计划，方案；阴谋', 'v', 'She’s nothing but a lying, scheming little monster! (她就是个爱撒谎、爱算计的小巫婆！)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'affect', '/ə\'fekt/', ' 影响； 感动', 'vt', 'the areas affected by the hurricane (受飓风影响的地区)', 1),
('en', 'CET-4', 'deaf', '/def/', ' 聋的； 不愿听的', 'adj', 'communication between deaf and hearing people (失聪者和听力正常者之间的交流)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'admire', '/əd\'maɪə/', ' 钦佩， 羡慕； 赞赏， 称赞， 夸奖', 'vt', 'I really admire the way she brings up those kids all on her own. (我十分佩服她独力把那些孩子抚养大。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'consequently', '/\'kɒnsɪkwəntli/', ' 因此， 因而， 所以', 'adv', 'Most computer users have never received any formal keyboard training. Consequently, their keyboard skills are inefficient. (大多数的电脑使用者都没有经过正规的键盘操作训练，因此他们的键盘技巧不够熟练。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'virus', '/\'vaɪərəs/', ' 病毒； 病毒性疾病， 病毒病', 'n', 'children infected with the Aids virus (感染艾滋病病毒的儿童)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'drain', '/dreɪn/', '排去，放水； 耗竭； 排水沟， 排水管', 'v', 'The boat drifted helplessly along the drain until some people saw him. (船儿无助地顺着排水沟漂流直到有人看见他。)', 3),
