('en', 'CET-4', 'subsequent', '/\'sʌbsɪkwənt/', ' 随后的， 后来的', 'adj', 'These skills were passed on to subsequent generations. (这些技能代代相传。)', 1),
('en', 'CET-4', 'indicate', '/\'ɪndɪkeɪt/', ' 标示， 表示， 表明', 'vt', 'The study indicates a connection between poverty and crime. (研究显示贫穷和犯罪有关联。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'scarcely', '/\'skeəsli/', ' 几乎不， 简直不； 决不； 刚刚， 才', 'adv', 'He had scarcely sat down when there was a knock at the door. (他刚坐下就有人敲门。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'panel', '/\'pænl/', ' 专门小组； 面， 板； 控制板， 仪表盘', 'n', 'He assembled a panel of scholars to advise him. (他集结了一个学者小组为他出谋划策。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'outstanding', '/ˌaut\'stændɪŋ/', ' 突出的， 杰出的； 未解决的； 未偿付的', 'adj', 'an outstanding example of a 13th-century castle (13世纪城堡的杰出典范)', 1),
('en', 'CET-4', 'charge', '/tʃɑːdʒ/', '索价；控告；充电，充满；向前冲； 费用； 管理； 控告， 指责； 电荷， 充电', 'v', 'They have the evidence to charge him. (他们有证据来指控他。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'sew', '/səu/', ' 缝制， 缝纫', 'v', 'I learned to sew at school. (我在学校学会了缝纫。)', 1),
('en', 'CET-4', 'oval', '/\'əuvl/', ' 椭圆形的；椭圆形', 'adj', '...the small oval framed picture of a little boy. (…一个小男孩的镶在椭圆形框架里的小幅照片。)', 3),
