('en', 'CET-4', 'procedure', '/prə\'siːdʒə/', ' 程序， 手续， 步骤', 'n', 'On board, we were given the usual talk on safety procedures (= what to do if an accident happens, or to prevent an accident ) . (在飞机上，我们听了例行的飞行安全讲解。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'sample', '/\'sɑːmpl/', '样品，试样，样本； 从…抽样； 品尝， 体验', 'n', 'They took a blood sample to test for hepatitis. (他们取了血样做肝炎化验。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'integrate', '/\'ɪntɪgreɪt/', ' 成为一体， 合并', 'v', 'He didn\'t integrate successfully into the Italian way of life. (他没有成功融入到意大利的生活方式中去。)', 1),
('en', 'CET-4', 'survivor', '/sə\'vaɪvə/', ' 生还者； 残存物', 'n', 'Don’t worry about Kurt; he’s a survivor. (不用担心库尔特，他是个坚强的人。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-4', 'applicant', '/\'æplɪkənt/', ' 申请人', 'n', 'We have had lots of applicants for these positions. (对这些职位我们已有了很多申请人。)', 2);
