('en', 'CET-4', 'scary', '/\'skeəri/', ' 引起惊慌的', 'adj', NULL, 2),
('en', 'CET-4', 'criticism', '/\'krɪtɪsɪzəm/', ' 批评， 批判； 评论， 评论文章', 'n', 'Despite strong criticism , the new system is still in place. (尽管遭到了猛烈的批评，新制度依然原封不动。)', 3),
