('en', 'CET-6', 'alternative', '/ɔ:lˈtɜ:nətɪv/', '代替品', 'n', 'New ways to treat arthritis may provide an alternative to painkillers. (治疗关节炎的新方法可能会提供一种止痛药的替代品。)', 3),
