('en', 'CET-6', 'anticipate', '/æn\'tɪsɪpeɪt/', '期望，预期', 'v', 'Sales are better than anticipated. (销量比预期要好。)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'anxiety', '/æŋ\'zaɪətɪ/', '焦虑', 'n', 'his feelings of anxiety (他焦虑的心情)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'apartment', '/əˈpɑ:tmənt/', '公寓', 'n', 'She lives in a small apartment. (她住在一套小公寓里。)', 3),
