('en', 'CET-6', 'approach', '/ə\'prəʊtʃ/', '方法', 'n', 'He decided to adopt a different approach and teach the Bible through story-telling. (他决定采用一种不同的方法，通过讲故事来教授《圣经》。)', 3),
