('en', 'CET-6', 'awareness', '/əˈweənəs/', '意识', 'n', 'Health officials have tried to raise awareness (=  improve people’s knowledge  ) about AIDS. (卫生部官员努力提高人们对艾滋病的认识。)', 2),
