('en', 'CET-6', 'boom', '/bu:m/', '繁荣', 'n', 'The boom has created job opportunities. (经济繁荣创造了就业的机会。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'boost', '/bu:st/', '提高', 'v', 'So go out there and boost your brainpower, your mind will thank you. (所以走出去提升你的智力，你的思想会感谢你自己。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'botanical', '/bəˈtænɪkl/', '植物学的', 'adj', 'The area is of great botanical interest. (该地区很有植物学研究价值。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'bother', '/\'bɒðə(r)/', '困扰', 'v', 'Danny, don’t bother Ellen while she’s reading. (丹尼，埃伦看书的时候不要去打扰她 。)', 4),
