('en', 'CET-6', 'buck', '/bʌk/', '反对；美元', 'v', 'He was a rebel who bucked the system (=  opposed rules or authority  ) . (他是一个反抗体制的叛逆者。)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'burden', '/\'bɜ:dn/', '负担', 'n', 'His family responsibilities had started to become a burden. (家庭责任已开始成为他的负担。)', 3),
