('en', 'CET-6', 'adaptation', '/ædəp\'teɪʃ(ə)n/', '适应；改编', 'n', 'Branagh won two awards for his screen adaptation of Shakespeare\'s Henry the Fifth. (布拉纳因他对莎士比亚的《亨利五世》的荧幕改编而获了两次奖。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'institute', '/\'ɪnstɪtjuːt/', '研究所，学会，学院', 'n', 'research institutes (研究所)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'biochemistry', '/baɪə(ʊ)\'kemɪstrɪ/', '生物化学', 'n', '...the effects of air pollutants on the biochemistry of plants or animals. (…大气污染物对植物或动物生化过程的影响。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'entrepreneur', '/ˌɒntrəprəˈnɜː(r)/', '企业家', 'n', '“You have to be an optimist to be an inventor or entrepreneur, ” he concludes. (要成为一位发明家或企业家，你必须得是个乐天派。)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'arise', '/ə\'raɪz/', '出现', 'v', 'A crisis has arisen in the Foreign Office. (外交部出现了危机。)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'ascend', '/ə\'send/', '上升', 'v', 'The plane ascended rapidly. (飞机迅速爬升。)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'combination', '/kɒmbɪ\'neɪʃ(ə)n/', '组合，结合', 'n', 'a combination nightclub and café (夜总会兼咖啡馆)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'definite', '/\'defɪnɪt/', '一定的，确切的', 'adj', 'It’s impossible for me to give you a definite answer. (我不可能给你明确的答复。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'preserve', '/prɪ\'zɜːv/', '保存，保护', 'v', 'We must encourage the planting of new trees and preserve our existing woodlands. (我们必须鼓励栽种新树木，同时也要保护现有的林地。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'program', '/\'prəʊɡræm/', '计划，安排', 'v', NULL, 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'proximately', '/\'prɔksimitli/', '近似，接近', 'adv', NULL, 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'lobbyist', '/\'lɒbɪɪst/', '游说者', 'n', 'He only pursues writing-only careers like novelist, journalist or copyrighter, when instead, he could have looked into being a minister, public relations assistant, editor or government lobbyist. (他只追求纯写作的职业，比如小说家、记者或剧作家，而实际上，他也可以找代理人、公共关系助手、编辑或政府说客之类的工作。)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'redundant', '/rɪ\'dʌnd(ə)nt/', '过剩的；失业的，被解雇的', 'adj', 'Seventy factory workers were made redundant in the resulting cuts. (在继而发生的裁员中，70名工厂工人被解雇。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'insurer', '/ɪn\'ʃʊərə/', '保险公司；承保人', 'n', 'This alternative would have to operate as any other insurer, on the basis of the premiums it collects. (这个选项如同其他的保险公司一样，依靠它收取的保费生存。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'overestimate', '/əʊvər\'estɪmeɪt/', '高估', 'v', 'He tends to overestimate his own abilities. (他往往高估自己的能力。)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'cropland', '/\'krɒp,lænd/', '农田', 'n', 'In addition to property damage, the floods have affected some of the nation\'s most fertile cropland, and are expected to have an impact on already rising food prices, especially for crops like corn. (除了财产损失之外，洪水还影响了美国一部分最肥沃的耕地，并预计对已经不断增加的粮食价格有所影响，尤其是像玉米这样的农作物。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'irrigation', '/ˌɪrɪˈɡeʃn/', '灌溉', 'n', 'Rivers and lakes provide us with water transport and irrigation. (江河湖泽给我们以舟楫和灌溉之利。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-6', 'contaminate', '/kən\'tæmɪneɪt/', '污染，弄脏', 'v', 'Drinking water supplies are believed to have been contaminated. (据信饮用水已受到污染。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'untreated', '/,ʌn\'tritɪd/', '未经处理的', 'adj', 'untreated sewage (未经处理过的污水)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'sanitation', '/sænɪ\'teɪʃ(ə)n/', '卫生环境，卫生设备', 'n', 'Overcrowding and poor sanitation are common problems in prisons. (过度拥挤和卫生状况差是监狱里的普遍问题。)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'echo', '/\'ekəʊ/', '随声附和，发出回声', 'v', 'The sound of an engine echoed back from the thick forest. (从茂密的森林里传来引擎的回声。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'duplicate', '/ˈdjuːplɪkeɪt/', '副本，复制品', 'n', 'She kept both the duplicate and the original. (她把复制本和原本都保留着。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'elevate', '/\'elɪveɪt/', '提升，举起；使高兴', 'v', 'Language has elevated humans above the other animals. (语言使人类高于其他动物。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'illustrate', '/\'ɪləstreɪt/', '阐明，说明', 'v', 'Let me give an example to illustrate the point. (让我举个例子来说明这一点。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-6', 'inquire', '/ɪn\'kwaɪə/', '询问', 'v', '‘Why are you doing that?’ the boy inquired. (“你为什么这么做？”男孩问道。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'prevail', '/prɪ\'veɪl/', '流行，普遍', 'v', 'A similar situation prevails in Canada. (同样的情况在加拿大也普遍存在。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'strap', '/stræp/', '用带帮助', 'v', 'soldiers with grenades strapped to their belts (腰带上绑着手榴弹的士兵)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'turbulent', '/\'tɜːbjʊl(ə)nt/', '动荡的，骚乱的', 'adj', 'the turbulent times of the French Revolution (法国大革命的动荡时期)', 2),
('en', 'CET-6', 'rebellion', '/rɪ\'beljən/', '叛逆', 'n', 'an armed rebellion (武装叛乱)', 2),
('en', 'CET-6', 'lofty', '/\'lɒftɪ/', '崇高的', 'adj', 'He stayed at the Four Seasons Hotel, from whose lofty heights he could see across New York. (他住在四季酒店，从酒店高处可以看到纽约的全景。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-6', 'render', '/\'rendə/', '给予', 'v', 'an obligation to render assistance to those in need (为有困难的人提供援助的义务)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'recyclable', '/riː\'saɪkləbl/', '可回收利用的', 'adj', 'recyclable cardboard packaging (可回收利用的纸板包装材料)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'trick', '/trɪk/', '骗局，诡计', 'n', 'Pretending he doesn’t remember is an old trick of his. (假装不记得是他的老花招了。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'certification', '/,sɜːtɪfɪ\'keɪʃən/', '证明，保证', 'n', 'We successfully completed the certification for open water diving. (我们成功地拿到了开放水域潜水证书。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'prevailing', '/prɪ\'veɪlɪŋ/', '流行的', 'adj', 'The prevailing mood of public opinion remained hostile. (公众仍普遍持敌对情绪。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'misled', '/,mɪs\'led/', '(mislead过去式)误导', '', 'He noted that a Scientologist hearing this would feel, with some justification, that he had misled his auditors about his progress. (他指出，山达基信徒听到这些之后，会有一些理由，感觉他在关于进展方面误导了听析师。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-6', 'elimination', '/ɪ,lɪmɪ\'neɪʃən/', '消除，淘汰', 'n', 'If you need to remove an agent you will have to do it by a process of elimination. (如果您需要删除代理，将必须通过消除进程的方式进行此工作。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'unqualified', '/ʌn\'kwɒlɪfaɪd/', '不合格的，不胜任的', 'adj', 'unqualified staff (不合格的员工)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'subconscious', '/sʌb\'kɒnʃəs/', '下意识的，潜意识的', 'adj', 'a subconscious fear of failure (对失败下意识的恐惧)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'incompetent', '/ɪn\'kɒmpɪt(ə)nt/', '无能力的，不胜任的', 'adj', 'an incompetent manager (不称职的经理)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'discriminate', '/dɪ\'skrɪmɪneɪt/', '歧视；区别', 'v', 'He is incapable of discriminating between a good idea and a terrible one. (他没能力在一个好主意和一个坏主意之间进行区分。)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'elegant', '/\'elɪg(ə)nt/', '高雅的，雅致的', 'adj', 'a tall, elegant young woman (身材高挑、举止优雅的年轻女子)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'gown', '/gaʊn/', '长袍', 'n', 'The new ball gown was a great success. (那件新款长礼服非常成功。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'bride', '/braɪd/', '新娘', 'n', 'Guests toasted the bride and groom with champagne. (客人们以香槟为新娘新郎敬酒。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'costume', '/\'kɒstjuːm/', '服装', 'n', 'the film’s lavish costumes and spectacular sets (影片中奢华的戏装和壮观的场景)', 4);
INSERT IGNORE INTO word_bank (language, category, word, phonetic, translation, part_of_speech, example, difficulty) VALUES
('en', 'CET-6', 'trade', '/treɪd/', '做买卖；交换', 'v', 'They had to travel into town to trade the produce from their farm. (他们不得不到镇上去出售他们农场的产品。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'deal', '/diːl/', '买卖毒品', 'v', 'Many users end up dealing to support their habit. (许多吸毒者最后都是靠做毒品买卖来供自己吸毒。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'hike', '/haɪk/', '作长途徒步旅行', 'v', 'He wants to hike round the world. (他打算徒步旅行环游世界一周。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'action', '/\'ækʃ(ə)n/', '行动', 'n', 'The government must take action (=do something) now to stop the rise in violent crime. (政府现在必须采取行动遏止暴力犯罪的上升。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'resultant', NULL, '作为结果而发生的', 'adj', 'She is still trying to get over the attack and the resultant injuries. (她仍在努力从袭击以及由此造成的伤害中恢复过来。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'consequent', '/\'kɒnsɪkw(ə)nt/', '作为结果的；必然的', 'adj', 'the rise in inflation and consequent fall in demand (通货膨胀的加剧和随之而来的需求下降)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'composer', '/kəm\'pəʊzə/', '作曲家', 'n', '...music by Strauss, Mozart, Beethoven, and other great composers. (…施特劳斯、莫扎特、贝多芬及其他伟大作曲家创作的音乐。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'slave', '/sleɪv/', '作苦工；奴役', 'v', 'When you\'re busy all day the last thing you want to do is spend hours slaving over a hot stove. (当你忙碌了一整天后，你最不愿意做的事就是花好几个钟头在灼热的火炉边辛苦地劳作。)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'grunt', '/grʌnt/', '作呼噜声；咕哝', 'v', 'Grunting with effort, she lifted me up. (她哼哧着费力地把我抱起来。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'abide', '/ə\'baɪd/', '忍受；遵守', 'v', 'I can\'t abide people with no sense of humour. (我讨厌和没有幽默感的人打交道。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'value', '/\'væljuː/', '尊重，重视；估价', 'v', 'Shelley valued her privacy. (谢利很重视自己的隐私。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'dignity', '/\'dɪgnɪtɪ/', '庄重；尊严；体面', 'n', 'We do this because we believe in the dignity and value of every person. (我们这样做是因为我们相信每个人的尊严和价值。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'outermost', '/\'aʊtəməʊst/', '最外面的，最远的', 'adj', 'the outermost stars (最远的恒星)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'optimum', '/\'ɒptɪməm/', '最优的，最适宜的', 'adj', 'optimum conditions for growth (最适宜生长的条件)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'initially', '/ɪ\'nɪʃ(ə)lɪ/', '最初，开始', 'adv', 'Stan initially wanted to go to medical school. (斯坦最初想进医学院。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-6', 'makeup', '/meɪkʌp/', '化妆品；性格；构造；组成', 'n', 'Normally she wore little makeup, but this evening was clearly an exception. (通常她很少化妆，可今晚显然是个例外。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'integral', '/ˈɪntɪɡrəl/', '作为组成部分的；内置的', 'adj', 'a TV and integral video recorder (内置录像机的电视)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'composition', '/kɒmpə\'zɪʃ(ə)n/', '组成，构成，结构', 'n', 'Some minerals have complex chemical compositions. (有些矿物的化学构成很复杂。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'block', '/blɒk/', '阻塞；障碍物', 'n', 'a major block to progress (进步的重大阻碍)', 2),
('en', 'CET-6', 'damn', '/dæm/', '谴责', 'v', '...a sensational book in which she damns the ultraright party. (…她谴责极右党派的一本耸人听闻的书。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'ample', '/\'æmp(ə)l/', '足够的；宽敞的', 'adj', 'There\'ll be ample opportunity to relax, swim and soak up some sun. (将会有充足的机会来放松、游泳和接受一些阳光。)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'suffice', '/sə\'faɪs/', '足够', 'v', 'A light lunch will suffice. (简单的午餐就够了。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'lease', '/liːs/', '租约，契约，租契', 'n', 'The landlord refused to renew his lease. (房东拒绝和他续签租约。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-6', 'charter', '/\'tʃɑːtə/', '包租（飞机、船等）', 'v', 'We chartered a boat to take us to some of the smaller islands. (我们包了一条船带我们到一些较小的岛上去。)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'headquarters', '/hed\'kwɔːtəz/', '总部', 'n', 'the headquarters of the United Nations (联合国总部)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'executive', '/ɪg\'zekjʊtɪv; eg-/', '（机构或公司的）主管，经理', 'n', 'a marketing executive (营销主管)', 2),
('en', 'CET-6', 'main', '/meɪn/', '总管道，干线', 'n', 'The report found that many of Yorkshire’s water mains needed replacing. (报告中说约克郡的很多自来水总管道需要更换。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-6', 'overall', '/\'əʊvərɔːl/', '总的', 'adj', '...the overall rise in unemployment. (…失业人数的总体上升。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'conceit', '/kən\'siːt/', '自负，自高自大', 'n', 'The conceit of the woman! (这个自负的女人！)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'ultraviolet', '/ʌltrə\'vaɪələt/', '紫外（线）的', 'adj', 'The sun\'s ultraviolet rays are responsible for both tanning and burning. (太阳的紫外线是皮肤晒黑和晒伤的原因。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'descendant', '/dɪ\'send(ə)nt/', '子孙，后裔', 'n', 'He was a direct descendant of Napoleon Bonaparte. (他是拿破仑·波拿巴的嫡系后裔。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-6', 'endow', '/ɪn\'daʊ; en-/', '资助；赋予', 'v', 'The ambassador has endowed a $1 million public-service fellowships programme. (大使资助了一个100万美元的公共服务奖学金项目。)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'datum', '/ˈdeɪtəm ; ˈdɑːtəm/', '资料；数据；已知数', 'n', NULL, 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'qualification', '/,kwɒlɪfɪ\'keɪʃ(ə)n/', '资格；学历', 'n', 'He left school without any qualifications. (他离校时没有拿到任何文凭。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-6', 'bourgeois', '/\'bʊəʒwɑː/', '中产阶级的；庸俗的；资产阶级的', 'adj', 'She came from a bourgeois family. (她来自一个中产阶级家庭。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'woodpecker', '/\'wʊdpekə/', '啄木鸟', 'n', 'A woodcutter and a woodpecker lived in the forest. (森林里居住着一个樵夫和一个啄木鸟。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'bump', '/bʌmp/', '撞上', 'v', 'They stopped walking and he almost bumped into them. (他们停下了脚步，这下他几乎撞到他们。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'crash', '/kræʃ/', '（发出巨响的） 猛撞', 'v', 'The door swung inwards to crash against a chest of drawers behind it. (门摆向里面，砰的一声猛力撞上了门后的五斗橱。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'way', '/weɪ/', '（特定的）状态，状况', 'n', 'My family was in a bad way financially. (我家当时经济窘迫。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'superb', '/suː\'pɜːb; sjuː-/', '壮丽的；超等的', 'adj', 'The food was superb. (食物好吃极了。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'ornament', '/\'ɔːnəm(ə)nt/', '装饰物', 'n', 'a shelf covered with books and ornaments (摆满书籍和装饰品的架子)', 2),
('en', 'CET-6', 'decorative', '/\'dek(ə)rətɪv/', '装饰的；可作装饰的', 'adj', 'a decorative panel above the door (门楣上的饰板)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'ornamental', '/ɔːnə\'ment(ə)l/', '装饰的', 'adj', '...an ornamental fountain. (…一个装饰性喷泉。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'mount', '/maʊnt/', '装配', 'v', 'Her husband mounts the work on velour paper and makes the frame. (她丈夫把作品装裱到丝绒纸上，又做了框架。)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'shipment', '/\'ʃɪpm(ə)nt/', '装载的货物；装货', 'n', 'The goods are ready for shipment. (货物已经准备好装运。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'can', '/kæn/', '装罐头', 'v', '...fruits and vegetables that will be canned, skinned, diced, or otherwise processed. (…将要经过装罐、去皮、切块或其他加工程序的水果和蔬菜。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-6', 'array', '/ə\'reɪ/', '（美观地）排列；陈列', 'v', 'make-up arrayed on the bathroom counter (盥洗台上摆放整齐的化妆品)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'diversion', '/daɪ\'vɜːʃ(ə)n; dɪ-/', '转移；改道；娱乐', 'n', 'A slight diversion in the road is causing major headaches for businesses along El Camino Real. (马路上的一小段绕行道让国王大道沿街的商家十分头疼。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'convert', '/kən\'vɜːt/', '转变，改变，变换', 'v', 'a 19th-century converted barn (由19世纪谷仓改建的房子)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'transition', '/træn\'zɪʃ(ə)n; trɑːn-; -\'sɪʃ-/', '转变，变迁；过渡', 'n', 'Making the transition from youth to adulthood can be very painful. (从青少年过渡到成年有时是一个非常痛苦的过程。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'torque', '/tɔːk/', '转（力）矩，扭（力）矩', 'n', 'In rotation, force becomes torque, mass becomes moment of inertia, and acceleration becomes angular acceleration. (在旋转时，力变成力矩，质量变成转动惯量，加速度变成角加速度。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'box', '/bɒks/', '（法庭的）专席', 'n', 'the jury box (陪审团席)', 2),
('en', 'CET-6', 'workshop', '/\'wɜːkʃɒp/', '专题讨论会', 'n', 'Trumpeter Marcus Belgrave ran a jazz workshop for young artists. (鼓手马库斯马贝尔格瑞夫为年轻艺术家们举办了一场爵士乐研讨会。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-6', 'patent', '/\'pæt(ə)nt; \'peɪt(ə)nt/', '专利的；专利', 'adj', 'a patent lock (专利锁)', 4),
