('en', 'CET-6', 'towards', '/tə\'wɔːdz; twɔːdz; \'tɔːdz/', '用于，有助于', 'prep', 'The money collected will be put towards repairing the church roof. (募集到的钱款将用于修缮教堂屋顶。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-6', 'plead', '/pliːd/', '为…辩护，抗辩', 'v', 'He appeared before the committee to plead his case. (他出现在委员会上为他的案子辩护。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'catalogue', '/\'kæt(ə)lɒg/', '为…编目录', 'v', 'The manuscripts have never been systematically catalogued. (一直没有系统地为这些手稿编过目录。)', 3),
