('en', 'CET-6', 'compensate', '/\'kɒmpenseɪt/', '补偿，赔偿', 'v', 'the government’s promise to compensate victims of the flood (政府对水灾灾民给予补偿的许诺)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'default', '/dɪ\'fɔːlt; \'diːfɔːlt/', '不履行义务；不履行义务', 'n', 'Mortgage defaults have risen in the last year. (按揭借款违约在近一年里呈上升趋势。)', 2),
