('en', 'CET-6', 'transplant', '/træns\'plɑːnt; trɑːns-; -nz-/', '移植（器官、皮肤等）；移植，移种（植物）', 'v', 'Surgeons have successfully transplanted a liver into a four-year-old boy. (外科医生成功地给一个四岁的男孩移植了肝脏。)', 3),
