('en', 'CET-6', 'plunder', '/\'plʌndə/', '掠夺，劫掠；掠夺，抢劫', 'v', 'The rich provinces of Asia Minor were plundered by the invaders. (小亚细亚的富饶地区遭到侵略者的劫掠。)', 3),
