('en', 'CET-6', 'transport', '/træn\'spɔːt/', '运输； 运输， 运输工具', 'vt', 'trucks used for transporting oil (运输石油的卡车)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'specific', '/spə\'sɪfɪk/', '特有的；明确的；具体的； 详情， 细节', 'adj', 'games suitable for specific age groups (适合特定年龄组的游戏)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'analogy', '/ə\'nælədʒi/', ' 比拟； 类比， 类推', 'n', 'The analogy between music and fragrance has stuck. (音乐与香味的类比已经深入人心了。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'application', '/ˌæplɪ\'keɪʃn/', ' 申请， 申请书； 施用， 涂抹； 应用， 实施； 实用性', 'n', 'We receive hundreds of job applications each year. (我们每年收到数百封求职信。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'productive', '/prə\'dʌktɪv/', ' 多产的， 富饶的； 富有成效的', 'adj', 'Most of us are more productive in the morning. (我们大多数人在早上更有效率。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'prune', '/pruːn/', ' 修剪， 修整； 删除， 削减', 'vt', 'The roses need pruning. (玫瑰需要修枝了。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'engage', '/ɪn\'geɪdʒ/', ' 使从事于， 聘用； 吸引， 占用； 使订婚', 'vt', 'She engaged the clutch and the car moved. (她踩下离合器，汽车便开动了。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-6', 'chord', '/kɔːd/', ' 和弦， 和音； 弦， 心弦', 'n', 'Many of the things she says will strike a chord with other young women. (她说的许多话都能引起其他年轻女子的共鸣。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'semester', '/sɪ\'mestə/', ' 学期', 'n', 'the fall semester (秋季学期)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'strategy', '/\'strætədʒi/', ' 战略， 策略', 'n', 'the government’s long-term economic strategy (政府的长期经济策略)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'remainder', '/rɪ\'meɪndə/', ' 余下的部分， 剩下的人数', 'n', 'The remainder must be paid by the end of June. (剩余款项必须在6月底之前支付。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'hypothesis', '/haɪ\'pɒθəsɪs/', ' 假设， 假说， 前提', 'n', 'One hypothesis is that the victim fell asleep while driving. (一种假设是受害人开车时睡着了。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-6', 'revolve', '/rɪ\'vɒlv/', ' 旋转', 'vi', 'The wheel began to revolve. (轮子开始旋转。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'collapse', '/kə\'læps/', ' 倒坍， 瓦解； 崩溃， 突然失败', 'n&vi', 'Uncle Ted’s chair collapsed under his weight. (椅子承受不了特德叔叔的重量，塌架了。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'territory', '/\'terətri/', ' 领土， 版图； 领域', 'n', 'Hong Kong is a Chinese territory. (香港是中国的领土。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-6', 'summon', '/\'sʌmən/', ' 召唤， 传唤； 鼓起， 振作； 召集， 召开', 'vt', 'Robert summoned the waiter for the bill. (罗伯特召唤服务员结账。)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'flare', '/fleə/', '闪耀，烧旺；突发，突然发怒； 闪光信号， 照明弹', 'vi', 'The fire flared up again. (火又忽地旺了起来。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'accurate', '/\'ækjərət/', ' 准确的， 正确无误的', 'adj', 'The brochure tries to give a fair and accurate description of each hotel. (该手册尽量公正、准确地介绍每一家酒店。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-6', 'legend', '/\'ledʒənd/', ' 传说， 传奇故事； 传奇人物', 'n', 'Local legend has it that (= says that ) the island was the original Garden of Eden. (当地传说这个岛就是伊甸园的原型。)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'maintain', '/meɪn\'teɪn/', ' 维持； 维修， 保养； 主张； 赡养', 'vt', 'Careers Officers maintain contact with young people when they have left school. (年轻人离开学校以后，职业指导员和他们保持联系。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'expertise', '/ˌekspɜː\'tiːz/', ' 专门知识， 专长', 'n', 'She was not an accountant and didn\'t have the expertise to verify all of the financial details. (她不是会计，不具有核查所有这些财政细目的专业知识。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-6', 'bargain', '/\'bɑːgən/', ' 讨价还价；特价商品；协议，交易', 'vi', 'They prefer to bargain with individual clients, for cash. (他们更愿意同个人客户洽谈，做现金交易。)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'erect', '/ɪ\'rekt/', ' 竖直的， 挺直的；建造，使竖立', 'adj', 'Martin stood erect on the platform. (马丁在讲台上笔直地站着。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'professional', '/prə\'feʃənl/', '职业的，专业的，专门的； 自由职业者， 专业人员', 'adj', 'This business plan looks very professional. (这个商业计划看上去很有专业水平。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-6', 'nil', '/nɪl/', ' 无， 零', 'n', 'The new machine reduced labour costs to almost nil. (新机器把劳动成本几乎降到零。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'identification', '/aɪˌdentɪfɪ\'keɪʃn/', ' 身份证明； 鉴定， 验明， 认出； 认同', 'n', 'Do you have any identification? (你有什么身份证明文件吗？)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'migrant', '/\'maɪgrənt/', ' 移居者， 移民； 候鸟， 迁移动物', 'n', 'The government divides asylum seekers into economic migrants and genuine refugees. (政府将寻求政治庇护的人划分为经济移民和真正的难民。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'protein', '/\'prəutiːn/', ' 蛋白质', 'n', 'Where do you get your protein? (你从哪里获得蛋白质？)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'annual', '/\'ænjuəl/', '每年的，一年一次的； 年报， 年鉴； 一年生的植物', 'adj', 'The school trip has become an annual event. (学校组织的旅行成了一年一度的活动。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'exclusive', '/ɪk\'skluːsɪv/', '奢华的，高级的；独有的；排斥的；不包括…的； 独家新闻', 'adj', 'Bel Air is an exclusive suburb of Los Angeles. (贝莱尔是洛杉矶郊外一处高级住宅区。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-6', 'repertoire', '/\'repətwɑː/', ' 全部节目', 'n', 'the behavioural repertoire of infants (婴幼儿的行为能力)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'poverty', '/\'pɒvəti/', ' 贫穷， 贫困', 'n', 'Millions of elderly people live in poverty . (数百万老年人生活在贫困之中。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'resort', '/rɪ\'zɔːt/', '求助，凭借，诉诸； 求助， 凭借， 诉诸； 求助的对象， 采用的手段； 常去之地， 胜地', 'vi', 'His punishing work schedule had made him resort to drugs. (他那累人的工作日程已经使他不得不求助于毒品了。)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'testify', '/\'testɪfaɪ/', '作证，证明；表明，说明； 作证， 证明', 'vi', 'Mr Molto has agreed to testify at the trial. (莫尔托先生已经同意出庭作证。)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'pearl', '/pɜːl/', ' 珍珠； 珠状物； 珍品', 'n', 'a pearl necklace (珍珠项链)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'conclusive', '/kən\'kluːsɪv/', ' 确实的； 最后的； 决定性的', 'adj', 'Her attorneys claim there is no conclusive evidence that any murders took place. (她的律师们声称没有任何发生过谋杀的确凿证据。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'margin', '/\'mɑːdʒɪn/', ' 页边空白； 差数， 差额； 余地； 边缘', 'n', 'Someone had scribbled a note in the margin . (有人在页边写了条批注。)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'apt', '/æpt/', ' 易于…的， 有…倾向的； 恰当的， 适宜的； 聪明的， 反应敏捷的', 'adj', '‘Love at first sight’ is a very apt description of how he felt when he saw her. (用“一见钟情”来形容他见到她时的感觉再恰当不过。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'remain', '/rɪ\'meɪn/', '剩下，余留，保持；仍然是； 残余； 残骸； 遗迹', 'vi', 'The refugees were allowed to remain in the UK. (难民获准留在英国。)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'pregnancy', '/\'pregnənsi/', ' 怀孕', 'n', 'This drug should not be taken during pregnancy. (这种药妊娠期间不得服用。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-6', 'shabby', '/\'ʃæbi/', ' 破旧的， 衣衫褴褛的； 卑鄙的； 不公正的', 'adj', 'Hugh’s jacket was old and shabby. (休的夹克衫又旧又破。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'toss', '/tɒs/', '掷钱币来决定；翻来覆去；扔，抛，掷；猛抬；拌；掷；使摇动，使颠簸； 掷钱币来决定； 猛抬头', 'vi', 'I’ve been tossing and turning all night. (我一晚上辗转反侧。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'demand', '/dɪ\'mɑːnd/', '要求，需要；询问； 要求， 需要', 'vt', 'Angry demonstrators demanded the resignation of two senior officials. (愤怒的示威者要求两名高级官员辞职。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'reel', '/riːl/', '摇摇晃晃地移动，蹒跚；眩晕，发昏；卷轴，卷筒，卷盘； 卷， 绕', 'vi', 'Andy reeled away from the bar and knocked over his stool. (安迪踉跄着离开吧台，把凳子都撞倒了。)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'pathetic', '/pə\'θetɪk/', ' 差劲的， 令人生厌的； 引起怜悯的， 可怜的， 可悲的', 'adj', 'You’re pathetic! Here, let me do it. (你真没用！来，让我做吧。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'dissipate', '/\'dɪsɪpeɪt/', '消散，消失； 使消散， 使消失； 浪费， 挥霍', 'vi', 'As he thought it over, his anger gradually dissipated. (他想明白后，怒气就渐渐消了。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'flask', '/flɑːsk/', ' 长颈瓶， 酒瓶， 烧瓶', 'n', 'He took out a metal flask from a canvas bag. (他从帆布袋里拿出了一个金属水瓶。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'accuse', '/ə\'kjuːz/', ' 指责， 归咎于', 'vt', 'The professor stands accused of (=  has been accused of  ) stealing his student’s ideas and publishing them. (那位教授被指控剽窃学生的观点拿去发表。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'disturbance', '/dɪ\'stɜːbəns/', ' 扰乱， 打扰； 骚乱， 混乱； 心神不安， 烦恼', 'n', 'There were disturbances in the crowd as fans left the stadium. (球迷离开体育场时，人群中发生了骚乱。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'visceral', '/\'vɪsərəl/', ' 内脏的， 腑脏的； 出自内心的， 发自肺腑的', 'adj', 'his visceral hatred of the ruling class (他对统治阶级发自肺腑的仇恨)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'simultaneous', '/ˌsɪml\'teɪniəs/', ' 同时发生的， 同时存在的； 同步的， 一齐的', 'adj', 'They grabbed each other’s hands in simultaneous panic. (他们俩同时惊慌起来，相互抓住对方的手。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-6', 'instructional', '/ɪn\'strʌkʃənl/', ' 指导的， 教育的', 'adj', '...instructional material designed to help you with your lifestyle. (...旨在为你的生活方式提供帮助的指导材料。)', 3);
INSERT IGNORE INTO word_bank (language, category, word, phonetic, translation, part_of_speech, example, difficulty) VALUES
('en', 'CET-6', 'guarantee', '/ˌgærən\'tiː/', '保证，担保物； 保证， 担保', 'n', 'They offer a two-year guarantee on all their electrical goods. (他们所有的电器产品都有两年的保修期。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'odor', '/\'əudə/', ' 气味', 'n', 'An odor of corruption hangs about him. (他浑身散发着腐化堕落的气味。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'predecessor', '/\'priːdɪsesə/', ' 前任， 前辈； 原有事物， 前身', 'n', 'Kennedy’s predecessor as President was the war hero Dwight Eisenhower. (肯尼迪总统的前任是战争英雄德怀特·艾森豪威尔。)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'acquire', '/ə\'kwaɪə/', ' 取得， 获得； 学到', 'vt', 'Manning hoped to acquire valuable works of art as cheaply as possible. (曼宁希望以尽可能低的价格买到有价值的艺术品。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'literal', '/\'lɪtərəl/', ' 照字面的， 原义的； 逐字的', 'adj', 'In many cases, the people there are fighting, in a literal sense, for their homes. (多数情况下，那里的人们实际上都是在为他们的家园而战斗。)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'notion', '/\'nəuʃn/', ' 概念， 观念； 意图， 想法， 念头', 'n', 'She had no notion what he meant. (她根本不明白他是什么意思。)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'default', '/dɪ\'fɔːlt/', ' 不履行义务， 拖欠；违约，拖欠；弃权；预设，缺省', 'v', 'The credit card business is down, and more borrowers are defaulting on loans. (信用卡生意正在走下坡路，更多的借贷人不履行还贷责任。)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'arc', '/ɑːk/', ' 弧形； 弧； 电弧， 弧光', 'n', 'the arc of a rainbow (彩虹的弧状)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'beverage', '/\'bevərɪdʒ/', ' 饮料', 'n', 'alcoholic beverages (含酒精的饮料)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'captive', '/\'kæptɪv/', '被俘虏的，被捕获的； 俘虏', 'adj', 'Her heart had begun to pound inside her chest like a captive animal. (她心如鹿撞，怦怦跳个不停。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'insane', '/ɪn\'seɪn/', ' 极蠢的， 荒唐的； 精神病的， 精神失常的， 疯狂的', 'adj', 'That’s an insane risk. (那是疯狂的冒险之举。)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'attribute', '/ə\'trɪbjuːt/', ' 把…归因于； 属性', 'vt', 'Women tend to attribute their success to external causes such as luck. (女性往往把她们的成功归因于外因，如运气。)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'cemetery', '/\'semətri/', ' 墓地， 公墓', 'n', 'Then we were at the entrance to the cemetery, and he asked. (不知不觉我们就来到了墓地入口，他又向我发问。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'genetic', '/dʒə\'netɪk/', '遗传的； [-s]遗传学', 'adj', 'genetic defects (遗传性缺陷)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'stitch', '/stɪtʃ/', ' 缝， 绣；一针，线迹；缝法，针法，编结法；突然剧痛', 'v', 'Mary is stitching a bedspread. (玛丽在缝床罩。)', 4),
('en', 'CET-6', 'triumph', '/\'traɪʌmf/', ' 成功；凯旋，胜利', 'vi', 'All her life, Kelly had stuck with difficult tasks and challenges, and triumphed. (凯利在一生中遭遇了种种艰巨任务与挑战，但成功了。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'vice', '/vaɪs/', ' 罪恶， 恶习， 缺点； 虎钳', 'n', 'the fight against vice on the streets (打击街头犯罪)', 2),
('en', 'CET-6', 'detection', '/dɪ\'tekʃn/', ' 察觉， 发觉； 侦查， 探测', 'n', '...the early detection of breast cancer. (…乳腺癌的早期发现。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-6', 'bowel', '/\'bauəl/', ' 肠； 内部， 深处', 'n', 'cancer of the bowel (肠癌)', 2),
('en', 'CET-6', 'arouse', '/ə\'rauz/', ' 引起； 唤起， 唤醒', 'vt', 'Matt’s behavior was arousing the interest of the neighbors. (马特的行为渐渐引起了邻居的兴趣。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'optimum', '/\'ɒptɪməm/', ' 最合适的， 最优的， 最佳的', 'adj', 'optimum conditions for growth (最适宜生长的条件)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'suppress', '/sə\'pres/', ' 压制， 镇压； 禁止发表， 查禁； 抑制， 忍住； 阻止…的生长', 'vt', 'The uprising was ruthlessly suppressed. (起义受到了残酷的镇压。)', 2),
('en', 'CET-6', 'pudding', '/\'pudɪŋ/', ' 布丁', 'n', 'chocolate pudding (巧克力布丁)', 2),
('en', 'CET-6', 'wrinkle', '/\'rɪŋkl/', ' 起皱纹；皱纹', 'v', 'Alex wrinkled up her nose at the smell. (闻到那股味道，亚历克丝皱起了鼻子。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'consensus', '/kən\'sensəs/', ' 一致， 一致同意', 'n', 'The EU Council of Finance Ministers failed to reach a consensus on the pace of integration. (欧盟财政部长会议未能就一体化的进度达成共识。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'boring', '/\'bɔːrɪŋ/', ' 令人厌烦的， 乏味的， 无聊的', 'adj', 'Her husband is about the most boring person I’ve ever met. (她丈夫可以说是我见过的最无聊的人。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'classic', '/\'klæsɪk/', '最优秀的，典型的，标准的；传统式样的，典雅的；文学名著，经典作品，杰作；优秀的典范；', 'adj', 'The Coca-Cola bottle is one of the classic designs of the last century. (可口可乐瓶是上个世纪的经典设计之一。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'supervise', '/\'suːpəvaɪz/', ' 监督， 管理， 指导', 'v', 'Griffiths closely supervised the research. (格里菲思密切指导该项研究。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'gossip', '/\'gɒsɪp/', ' 传播流言蜚语；流言蜚语；爱说长道短的人', 'vi', 'Who knows how much of the gossip was true. (有谁知道这些流言蜚语有多少是真的呢？)', 2),
('en', 'CET-6', 'describe', '/dɪ\'skraɪb/', ' 形容， 描写； 画出', 'vt', 'The police asked her to describe the man. (警察叫她描述一下那名男子。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'dilemma', '/dɪ\'lemə/', ' 窘境， 困境', 'n', 'a moral dilemma (道德上进退两难的窘境)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'engagement', '/ɪn\'geɪdʒmənt/', ' 订婚， 婚约； 约会', 'n', 'Their engagement was announced in the paper. (他们订婚的消息在报上公布了。)', 3),
('en', 'CET-6', 'wealthy', '/\'welθi/', ' 富的， 富裕的', 'adj', 'the wealthy nations of the world (世界上的富国)', 2),
('en', 'CET-6', 'slum', '/slʌm/', ' 贫民窟', 'n', 'a slum area (贫民区)', 2),
