('en', 'CET-6', 'medication', '/ˌmedɪ\'keɪʃn/', ' 药物治疗； 药物', 'n', 'When somebody comes for treatment I always ask them if they are on any medication. (有人来治疗时，我总是会问他们是否在服药。)', 3),
