('en', '托福', 'responsibility', '/rɪˌspɒnsəˈbɪlətɪ/', '责任,职责', 'n', 'Kelly’s promotion means more money and more responsibility. (凯利获得提升，这意味着钱多了，责任也更大了。)', 3),
('en', '托福', 'exaggerate', '/ɪg\'zædʒəreɪt; eg-/', '夸大,夸张', 'v', 'I couldn’t sleep for three days – I’m not exaggerating. (我三天没睡觉了——一点不夸张。)', 4),
