('en', '托福', 'disease', '/dɪ\'ziːz/', '疾病', 'n', 'His father died of heart disease. (他父亲死于心脏病。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'resist', '/rɪ\'zɪst/', '抵抗,反抗', 'v', 'He resisted pressure to resign. (他顶住压力，没辞职。)', 4),
