('en', '托福', 'calcium', '/\'kælsɪəm/', '钙', 'n', 'Like fibre, calcium binds with fat molecules and helps flush them out through the intestine. (像纤维、钙可以和脂肪分子结合，帮助他们彻底的通过肠道。)', 5),
