('en', '托福', 'genius', '/\'dʒiːnɪəs/', '天才, 天赋', 'n', 'The film reveals Fellini’s genius. (这部影片展现了费里尼的天赋。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'caterpillar', '/\'kætəpɪlə/', '毛虫', 'n', 'A caterpillar transforms into a butterfly. (毛虫变成了蝴蝶。)', 5),
