('en', '托福', 'worship', '/\'wə:ʃip/', '崇拜, 爱慕', 'n&vt', 'He absolutely worships her. (他太崇拜她了。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'hat', '/hæt/', '帽子 vt戴帽子', 'n', 'Maria was wearing a beautiful new hat. (玛丽亚戴着一顶漂亮的新帽子。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'avenue', '/\'æv(ə)njuː/', '林荫道,方法', 'n', 'The president wants to explore every avenue towards peace in the region. (总统想探索一切途径实现该地区的和平。)', 3),
('en', '托福', 'consensus', '/kən\'sensəs/', '一致，同意', 'n', 'The EU Council of Finance Ministers failed to reach a consensus on the pace of integration. (欧盟财政部长会议未能就一体化的进度达成共识。)', 5),
('en', '托福', 'sugar', '/\'ʃʊgə/', '糖', 'n', 'Do you take sugar in your coffee? (你的咖啡加糖吗？)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'ethic', '/\'eθɪk/', '道德规范', 'n', 'The old ethic of hard work has given way to a new ethic of instant gratification. (旧有的崇尚勤勉的道德观已被及时行乐的新观念所取代。)', 5);
