('en', '托福', 'softwood', '/\'sɒf(t)wʊd/', '软木材', 'n', 'It would be better to use softwood, which grows in cooler climes in sustainably managed forests. (因此，更好的办法是使用软木，软木生长在更凉爽的气候区，并且容易再生。)', 4),
