('en', '托福', 'slate', '/sleɪt/', '板岩,石板', 'n', 'There were several slates missing from the roof. (房顶有几块石板瓦掉了。)', 3),
('en', '托福', 'reptilian', '/rep\'tɪlɪən/', '爬行类动物', 'n', 'A man who switches on his emotions is more likely to go into a reptilian mode and lash out vocally or become aggressive. (情绪变化的男人更可能进入爬虫类动物模式，进行口头攻击或变得咄咄逼人。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'overirrigation', NULL, '过量灌溉', 'n', NULL, 4),
('en', '托福', 'bold', '/bəʊld/', '大胆的, 无礼的', 'adj', 'In a surprisingly bold move , he is threatening court action against the company. (他出人意料地做出一个大胆举动，威胁要起诉这家公司。)', 5),
('en', '托福', 'conclusive', '/kən\'kluːsɪv/', '决定性的,结论性的', 'adj', 'If you want change in your life to be permanent, strong, and conclusive you need a support group.  (如果你想在生命中有永久的、牢固的、决定性的改变，你需要一个支持小组。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'file', '/faɪl/', '文档 vt登记备案 ,提出', 'n', 'We will keep your details on file (= store them for later use ) . (我们将把你的详细资料存档。)', 4),
