('en', '托福', 'cedar', '/\'siːdə/', '雪松', 'n', 'The yacht is built of cedar strip planking. (这艘游艇用雪松木板材制成。)', 5),
('en', '托福', 'vanish', '/\'vænɪʃ/', '消失', 'v', 'My keys were here a minute ago but now they’ve vanished. (我的钥匙刚刚还在这里，现在却不翼而飞了。)', 5),
