('en', '托福', 'recrystallize', NULL, '( 使) 再结晶', 'v', 'After the die, it takes some time for polymer molecules to get reoriented to a random manner again, and to recrystallize. (经过模具之后，聚合物分子需要一定的时间进行重新定型回复到随机方向，并再次结晶。)', 4),
