('en', '托福', 'narrator', '/nə\'reɪtə/', '讲述者', 'n', '“I can never look now at the Milky Way”, said the narrator in “The Sentinel”, “without wondering from which of those banked clouds of stars the emissaries are coming. (“现在，我再也看不到银河了。” 在《哨兵》中，他借叙述者的口说道，“没错，那层层叠叠的星云中，我们期待的使者正在向这里赶来。)', 4),
