('en', '托福', 'masterpiece', '/\'mɑːstəpiːs/', '杰作, 名著', 'n', 'Mary Shelley was just 18 when she wrote the horror masterpiece ‘Frankenstein’. (玛丽•雪莱创作《科学怪人》这部恐怖小说名作的时候年仅18岁。)', 4),
