('en', '托福', 'friendliness', '/\'fren(d)lɪnɪs/', '友谊,友善', 'n', 'His kind smile soon generated friendliness. (他友善的微笑很快造成了友好的气氛。)', 3),
('en', '托福', 'sympathy', '/\'sɪmpəθɪ/', '同情, 同情心', 'n', 'Our sympathies are with the families of the victims. (我们向受害者家庭表示慰问。)', 3),
('en', '托福', 'wingspan', '/\'wɪŋspæn/', '[空]翼展', 'n', '...a glider with an 18-foot wingspan. (...一架翼幅为18英尺的滑翔机。)', 4),
