('en', '托福', 'explosive', '/ɪk\'spləʊsɪv; ek-/', '爆炸(性)的,暴露；爆炸物', 'adj', 'Because the gas is highly explosive, it needs to be kept in high-pressure containers. (由于这种气体极易爆炸，因此需要保存在高压容器内。)', 5),
('en', '托福', 'rooftop', '/\'rʊf\'tɑp/', '屋顶；屋顶上的', 'n', 'Spectators stood on rooftops to watch the parade. (观众站在屋顶上观看庆祝游行。)', 5),
('en', '托福', 'interplanetary', '/ɪntə\'plænɪt(ə)rɪ/', '太阳系内的,行星间的', 'adj', 'interplanetary space missions (星际太空飞行任务)', 3),
('en', '托福', 'actor', '/\'æktə/', '男演员,行动者', 'n', 'His father was an actor in the Cantonese Opera Company. (他父亲曾是粤剧团的一名演员。)', 4),
