('en', '托福', 'dizzy', '/\'dɪzɪ/', '(指人)晕眩的；使人晕眩的', 'adj', 'The heat and the champagne made him feel dizzy . (高温和香槟酒使他感到眩晕。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'stir', '/stɜː/', '轰动, 搅动；搅拌,激起', 'n', 'Give that pan a stir , will you? (把那锅东西搅一搅，好吗？)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'woodwind', '/\'wʊdwɪnd/', '木管乐器', 'n', 'woodwind instruments such as the flute or saxophone (木管乐器，如长笛和萨克斯管)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'humble', '/\'hʌmbl/', '卑下的, 微贱的；使卑下, 挫', 'adj', 'a modest and humble man (一个谦卑的男人)', 5),
('en', '托福', 'unsuccessful', '/ʌnsək\'sesfʊl; -f(ə)l/', '不成功的,失败的', 'adj', 'an unsuccessful attempt to climb Qomolangma (攀登珠穆朗玛峰的失败尝试)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'seeker', '/\'siːkə/', '搜索者, 探求者', 'n', 'I am a seeker after truth. (我是一名真理的追求者。)', 3),
('en', '托福', 'unfavorably', NULL, '不利地,不适宜地', 'adv', NULL, 5),
('en', '托福', 'spatial', '/\'speɪʃ(ə)l/', '空间的', 'adj', '...the spatial distribution of black employment and population in South Africa. (…南非黑人就业和人口的空间分布。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'symphony', '/\'sɪmf(ə)nɪ/', '交响乐, 交响曲', 'n', 'Bruckner’s Fifth Symphony (布鲁克纳的《第五交响曲》)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'chronological', '/krɒnə\'lɒdʒɪk(ə)l/', '按年代顺序排列的', 'adj', 'We arranged the documents in chronological order . (我们把这些文件按时序排列。)', 3),
('en', '托福', 'superb', '/suː\'pɜːb; sjuː-/', '庄重的, 华丽的, 极好的', 'adj', 'The food was superb. (食物好吃极了。)', 3),
('en', '托福', 'pylon', '/\'paɪlən; \'paɪlɒn/', '塔门, 路标塔', 'n', NULL, 3),
('en', '托福', 'acquaintance', '/ə\'kweɪnt(ə)ns/', '相识, 熟人', 'n', 'She was a casual acquaintance of my family in Vienna. (她是我们家在维也纳的一个交情不深的朋友。)', 3),
('en', '托福', 'decease', '/dɪ\'siːs/', '死亡；死', 'n', 'On your decease, the house passes to your wife. (在你死后，房子由你妻子继承。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'cult', '/kʌlt/', '祭仪, 礼拜式', 'n', NULL, 4),
('en', '托福', 'divine', '/dɪ\'vaɪn/', '神圣的, 非凡的 n牧师 v占卜', 'adj', 'He suggested that the civil war had been a divine punishment. (他暗示此次内战是上天的惩罚。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'colonel', '/\'kɜːn(ə)l/', '陆军上校, 团长', 'n', NULL, 3),
('en', '托福', 'marshal', '/\'mɑːʃ(ə)l/', '元帅 v整顿, 排列', 'n', 'Marshal Zhukov (朱可夫元帅)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'dilemma', '/dɪ\'lemə; daɪ-/', '进退两难的局面, 困难的选择', 'n', 'a moral dilemma (道德上进退两难的窘境)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'validity', '/və\'lɪdɪtɪ/', '有效性, 合法性, 正确性', 'n', 'While each of these might have some validity, in many cases the same general comments may also apply to many of the other projects you work on. (尽管其中每个问题可能具有某些正确性，但是在许多情况下，一般性评论还可能适用于您从事的其他项目。)', 5),
('en', '托福', 'Militant', '/\'mɪlɪt(ə)nt/', '好战的n好斗者', 'adj', NULL, 3),
('en', '托福', 'dismiss', '/dɪs\'mɪs/', '解散, 下课, 解职,', 'v', 'The class was dismissed early today. (今天这个班级提早放学。)', 5),
('en', '托福', 'superficial', '/,suːpə\'fɪʃ(ə)l; ,sjuː-/', '表面的, 肤浅的n浅薄的人', 'adj', 'They only have the most superficial understanding of prison life. (他们对监狱生活只有最粗浅的了解。)', 3),
('en', '托福', 'federalist', '/\'fedərəlɪst/', '联邦党,联邦制拥护者', 'n', 'Many Quebeckers are federalists. (很多魁北克人是联邦主义者。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'biographical', '/baɪə\'græfɪk(ə)l/', '传记的,传记体的', 'adj', 'The book contains few biographical details. (此书包含的生平细节很少。)', 5),
('en', '托福', 'magnetism', '/\'mægnɪtɪz(ə)m/', '磁, 磁力, 吸引力, 磁学', 'n', 'his personal magnetism (他的个人魅力)', 5),
('en', '托福', 'sonar', '/\'səʊnɑː/', '声纳, 声波定位仪', 'n', NULL, 5),
('en', '托福', 'perennial', '/pə\'renɪəl/', '终年的, 长期的', 'adj', 'Lack of resources has been a perennial problem since the beginning. (财力不足从最初起就一直是个问题。)', 3),
('en', '托福', 'infiltration', '/,ɪnfɪl\'treɪʃən/', '渗透', 'n', 'And what concerns do you have about their infiltration as we move forward? (随着我们的向前推进，您对他们的军事渗入有何看法？)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'breakage', '/\'breɪkɪdʒ/', '破坏, 破损, 破损量', 'n', 'Brushing wet hair can cause stretching and breakage. (梳刷湿的头发会导致拉抻和破损。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'bounce', '/baʊns/', '(使)反跳, 弹起 n(球)跳起, 弹回', 'v', 'Stop bouncing up and down on the sofa. (别在沙发上蹦来蹦去了。)', 3),
('en', '托福', 'apace', '/ə\'peɪs/', '快速地, 急速地', 'adv', 'Expansion of the company has continued apace . (该公司继续迅速扩张。)', 3),
('en', '托福', 'herbicide', '/\'hɜːbɪsaɪd/', '除草剂', 'n', 'But water containing the herbicide cannot be released back into the river and it is known that low water levels can harm river ecosystems accustomed to higher levels. (但含有除草剂的水不能再排向河流，而且我们知道低水位将会对习惯于高水位的河流生态系统造成危害。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'compactness', NULL, '紧密, 简洁', 'n', 'This is gauged by the faithfulness of the implementation to the algorithm\'s specifications, the compactness of the algorithm, and the speed with which it encrypts. (这是由实现对算法规范的忠实性、算法的简洁性和加密的速度来衡量的。)', 3),
('en', '托福', 'pluck', '/plʌk/', '勇气v拔, 采集', 'n', 'It takes a lot of pluck to stand up to a bully. (不向恃强凌弱者屈服需要很大勇气。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'springboard', '/\'sprɪŋbɔːd/', '跳板vi利用跳板', 'n', 'The 1981 budget was the springboard for an economic miracle. (1981年的预算造就了一场经济奇迹。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'hurl', '/hɜːl/', '用力或猛烈的投掷v用力投掷', 'n', NULL, 3),
('en', '托福', 'genu', '/\'dʒenjuː/', '膝', 'n', 'Have on parental caress by every means, next issueless pester genu disturbing, everyday carefree, live easily comfortable. (上有父母亲的百般呵护，下无子女的缠膝烦扰，天天无忧无虑的，活得轻松安闲。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'localization', '/,ləʊkəlaɪ\'zeɪʃən/', '地方化, 局限, 定位', 'n', NULL, 4),
('en', '托福', 'airborne', '/\'eəbɔːn/', '空运的, 空气传播的', 'adj', 'airborne pollutants (空气传播的污染物)', 4);
INSERT IGNORE INTO word_bank (language, category, word, phonetic, translation, part_of_speech, example, difficulty) VALUES
('en', '托福', 'catalyst', '/\'kæt(ə)lɪst/', '催化剂', 'n', 'I very much hope that this case will prove to be a catalyst for change. (我非常希望这件事终将成为促成变化的催化剂。)', 5),
('en', '托福', 'rarity', '/\'reərɪtɪ/', '稀有', 'n', 'Some of these plants are national rarities. (这些植物中有些是国家珍品。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'fend', '/fend/', '保护, 供养', 'v', 'Protection of the vital oil fields remained a unifying goal, and the United States viewed a more capable Saudi military, one able to fend off regional and domestic threats, as key to attaining it. (保护重要石油地区的安全是两国统一的目标，而美军认为一个能够抵御地区和国内威胁的更加强大的沙特军队，是实现这一目标的关键。)', 3),
('en', '托福', 'beneficiary', '/benɪ\'fɪʃ(ə)rɪ/', '受惠者, 受益人', 'n', 'One of the main beneficiaries of the early election is thought to be the former president. (前总统被认为是早期选举的主要受益者之一。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'leaflet', '/ˈliːflət/', '小叶, 传单', 'n', 'Campaigners handed out leaflets on passive smoking. (发起人分发了关于被动吸烟的传单。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'genotype', '/\'dʒenətaɪp; \'dʒiːn-/', '基因型', 'n', '"It will only be a good idea to know your APOE genotype when there\'s something we can do about it, " she says. (“只有当我们可以做出改变的时候，知道你的载脂蛋白E基因才 会是一件好事”，她说。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'affordable', '/ə\'fɔːdəbəl/', '负担得起的', 'adj', '...the availability of affordable housing. (…多数人支付得起的房产的供应。)', 5),
('en', '托福', 'myxoma', '/mɪk\'səʊmə/', '[医]粘液瘤', 'n', 'Objective To review the experience in the diagnosis and surgical treatment of cardiac myxoma. (目的探讨心脏黏液瘤的诊断和外科治疗。)', 3),
('en', '托福', 'reply', '/rɪ\'plaɪ/', '答复, 答辩v答复, 回击', 'n', 'I tried calling, but there was no reply. (我试着打电话去，但没有人接。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'importation', '/,ɪmpɔː\'teɪʃən/', '进口, 输入品', 'n', 'We should stop the importation of these birds which are sold as commodities and endure lives of boredom in cages. (这种作为商品出售的鸟被关在笼子里忍耐着无聊的生活，我们应当停止它的进口。)', 5),
('en', '托福', 'deny', '/dɪ\'naɪ/', '否认, 拒绝', 'v', 'The government denied the existence of poverty among 16- and 17-year-olds. (政府否认十六七岁的青少年当中存在贫困问题。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'intaglio', '/ɪn\'tælɪəʊ; -\'tɑːl-/', '凹雕, 阴雕vt凹雕', 'n', NULL, 4),
('en', '托福', 'elaboration', '/ɪ,læbə\'reɪʃən/', '苦心经营, 详尽的细节', 'n', 'The short answer will to power requires some elaboration as to the methods whereby one might effect such a transformation of ones experience. (简短的回答能够激励出苦心经营的需要,至于人们如何影响这样一种,个人经历的转变的方法。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'congenital', '/kən\'dʒenɪt(ə)l/', '先天的,天生的,天赋的', 'adj', 'congenital abnormalities (先天畸形)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'blockage', '/\'blɒkɪdʒ/', '封锁, 妨碍', 'n', NULL, 4),
('en', '托福', 'photodissociation', '/\'fəʊtə(ʊ)dɪ,səʊʃɪ\'eɪʃ(ə)n/', '[物][化]光离解,光解 (作用)', 'n', 'Different photodissociation spectra, the action spectrum as function of laser wavelength, and ratio curve of different channels were obtained. (得到了反应的光解谱和作为波长函数的光解行为光谱以及各反应通道的分支比。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'survivor', '/sə\'vaɪvə/', '生还者, 残存物', 'n', 'Don’t worry about Kurt; he’s a survivor. (不用担心库尔特，他是个坚强的人。)', 5),
('en', '托福', 'uninhabited', '/ʌnɪn\'hæbɪtɪd/', '无人居住的,杳无人迹的', 'adj', 'an uninhabited island (杳无人迹的荒岛)', 3),
('en', '托福', 'aphid', '/\'eɪfɪd/', '[动]蚜虫', 'n', 'Anyway, Moran sat down at her computer and looked through the aphid genome for the genes that are responsible for carotenoids. (无论你听说过没有，现在，莫兰正坐在她的电脑前，研究蚜虫基因组的资料，查找负责类胡萝卜素的基因。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'weekend', '/wiːkˈɛnd/', '周末, 周末休假 a周末的', 'n', 'Are you doing anything nice this weekend? (这个周末你有什么好的安排？)', 3),
('en', '托福', 'Miami', NULL, '迈阿密(美国佛罗里州达东南部港市)', 'n', 'Do you have any flights to Miami? (你们有飞迈阿密的班机吗？)', 5),
('en', '托福', 'weekday', '/\'wiːkdeɪ/', '周日, 平日', 'n', 'If you want to avoid the crowds, it\'s best to come on a weekday. (如果你想避开人流，最好在工作日来。)', 3),
('en', '托福', 'paralyze', '/\'pærəlaiz/', '使瘫痪, 使麻痹', 'v', 'You can bet that would truly paralyze the flow of credit: Does anyone believe Washington can manage banks? (你可以打赌，这会使流动的信贷真正限于瘫痪：真有人相信华盛顿可以经营银行吗？)', 3),
('en', '托福', 'articulate', '/ɑ:\'tɪkjʊleɪt/', '有关节的, 发音清晰的 v用关节连接, 接合', 'adj', 'bright, articulate 17-year-olds (聪明伶俐的17岁少年)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'airway', '/\'eəweɪ/', '空中航线, 通风孔', 'n', 'How does a private pilot get access to the airways? (一个私人飞机的飞行员如何获得航线使用权呢？)', 5),
('en', '托福', 'outgassing', NULL, '除气 v除气 a释气的', 'n', NULL, 4),
('en', '托福', 'overrun', '/əʊvə\'rʌn/', '泛滥成灾 v超过, 泛滥', 'n', 'cost overruns of £2 billion (20亿英镑的超额费用)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'fever', '/\'fiːvə/', '发烧, 狂热 v(使)发烧, 狂热', 'n', 'Andy has a fever and won’t be coming into work today. (安迪发烧了，今天不来上班。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'loosen', '/\'luːs(ə)n/', '解开, 放松, 松开', 'v', 'You’ll need a spanner to loosen that bolt. (你需要扳手来拧开那个螺栓。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'Netherland', NULL, '荷兰', 'n', 'Some of the best parts of “Netherland” are Chuck’s rambling political and cultural monologues, delivered as Hans drives him around the boroughs. (《荷兰》的一些最好的部分就是恰克漫谈政治和文化时的独白，是在汉斯开车带他时发表的。)', 3),
('en', '托福', 'incorrectly', '/ˌɪnkə\'rektlɪ/', '错误地,不适当地', 'adv', NULL, 4),
('en', '托福', 'Athens', '/ˈæθɪnz/', '雅典(希腊首都)', 'n', 'Can you tell me something about the Acropolis in Athens? (你能给我讲一些关于雅典卫城的事吗?)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'tollgate', '/\'təʊlɡeɪt/', '征收通行税的关卡, 关门', 'n', NULL, 5),
('en', '托福', 'bravely', '/\'breivli/', '勇敢地', 'adv', 'They bravely buffeted misfortune\'s billows. (他们勇敢地与灾祸的恶浪搏斗。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'unwilling', '/ʌn\'wɪlɪŋ/', '不愿意的,不情愿的', 'adj', 'an unwilling helper (勉强来帮忙的人)', 3),
('en', '托福', 'impressively', NULL, '令人难忘地,  令人印象深刻地', 'adj', NULL, 3),
('en', '托福', 'overkill', '/\'əʊvəkɪl/', '过度的杀伤威力；超量杀伤', 'n', NULL, 5),
('en', '托福', 'Athenian', '/ə\'θi:njən/', '/a雅典(人)(的)', 'n', NULL, 3),
('en', '托福', 'outskirt', '/\'aʊtskɜːt/', '外边, 郊区', 'n', 'Mianyang Nanjiao Airport is seated in southern outskirt of Minayang city proper, operating flights to Beijing, Shanghai and Guangzhou. (绵阳南郊机场位于绵阳南部郊区，有航班开往北京，上海和广州。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'milligram', '/\'miliɡræm/', '毫克', 'n', '...0.5 milligrams of mercury. (…0.5毫克的汞。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'supplier', '/sə\'plaɪə/', '供应者, 补充者', 'n', '...one of the country\'s biggest food suppliers. (…该国最大的食品供应商之一。)', 3),
('en', '托福', 'closeness', '/\'kləusnis/', '紧闭, 狭窄', 'n', NULL, 4),
('en', '托福', 'stately', '/\'steɪtlɪ/', '庄严的, 堂皇的', 'adj', 'the stately progress of the procession (游行队伍缓慢而庄严的行进)', 5),
('en', '托福', 'infinitesimally', NULL, '极小地', 'adv', 'That may not seem like much, especially given the proton\'s infinitesimally tiny size. (这也许并不起眼，尤其是考虑到质子极小的尺寸。)', 5),
('en', '托福', 'viability', '/,vaɪə\'bɪlətɪ/', '生存能力', 'n', 'It evaluates the basic viability of the project. (它估计了项目的基本生存能力。)', 5),
('en', '托福', 'lyric', '/\'lɪrɪk/', '抒情诗, 歌词', 'n', 'He wrote some great music, but the lyrics weren’t that good. (他创作过一些不错的曲子，但歌词不是很好。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'dispose', '/dɪ\'spəʊz/', '处理,布置, 安排', 'v', 'Chinese vases are disposed around the gallery. (中国花瓶摆放在展馆四周。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'uranus', '/ˈjʊərənəs;jʊˈreɪnəs/', '天王星', 'n', NULL, 3),
('en', '托福', 'rocket', '/\'rɒkɪt/', '火箭', 'n', 'The rocket was launched from a space research base. (火箭从一个太空研究基地发射升空。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'insulator', '/\'ɪnsjʊleɪtə/', '绝缘体, 绝热器', 'n', 'Wood is an excellent insulator. (木材是很好的绝缘体。)', 3),
('en', '托福', 'keelboat', '/\'kiːlbəʊt/', '一种河船', 'n', 'As it\'s name implies, keelboat has a keel to help it go straight in the water. Keelboat is a large, heavy, stable, and multi-people controlled boat that is more suitable on long distance sailing. (特点-船底有一块牢固的稳向板和压铅，排水量年夜、构造庞大、 价钱昂贵， 多人操作，适于长隔断比赛和远洋探险。)', 3),
('en', '托福', 'manageable', '/\'mænɪdʒəb(ə)l/', '易处理的，易管理的', 'adj', 'Divide the task into manageable sections. (把工作分成几个部分，方便处理。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'metaphor', '/\'metəfə; -fɔː/', '隐喻, 暗喻', 'n', 'She uses some wonderful images and metaphors in her writing. (她在作品中用了一些绝妙的比喻和暗喻。)', 5),
('en', '托福', 'disaffection', '/,dɪsə\'fɛkʃən/', '不满', 'n', '...people\'s disaffection with their country and its leaders. (...人民对自己国家和领导人的不满。)', 4),
