('en', '托福', 'assembly', '/ə\'semblɪ/', '集会，集合;组装', 'n', 'Police have imposed conditions on public assemblies. (警方给公共集会设置了条件。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'stressful', '/\'stresfʊl; -f(ə)l/', '紧张的, 压力重的', 'adj', 'Moving to a new house is a very stressful experience. (搬新家是件很劳心的事。)', 4),
