('en', '托福', 'homeownership', NULL, '房主', 'n', 'And all of us will pay an even steeper price if we allow this crisis to continue to deepen, a crisis which is unraveling homeownership, the middle class, and the American Dream itself. (如果我们允许这个危机继续恶化下去，我们所有的人将会付出更大的代价。 这个危机正在瓦解美国人对房屋的拥有权、中产阶级以及美国梦本身。)', 3),
