('en', '托福', 'designation', '/dezɪg\'neɪʃ(ə)n/', '指示, 指定, 名称', 'n', 'Her official designation is Systems Manager. (她的正式头衔是系统经理。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'wretched', '/\'retʃɪd/', '可怜的, 恶劣的', 'adj', 'I was shocked to see their wretched living conditions. (看到他们恶劣的生活条件我很震惊。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'entrench', '/ɪn\'tren(t)ʃ; en-/', '以壕沟防护,保护', 'v', NULL, 4),
