('en', '托福', 'woodworking', '/\'wʊd,wɜːkɪŋ/', '木工艺, 木工行业；干木工活的', 'n', 'DIYing has given a major shot in the arm to the crafting industry, which covers scrapbooking, traditional needlework as well as hobbies like woodworking. (DIY给手工艺界带来重大冲击，这个行业涵盖剪贴薄制作、传统的缝纫工作以及一些业余爱好，例如木工手艺等。)', 4),
