('en', '托福', 'knead', '/niːd/', '揉(面等)成团, 按摩', 'v', 'Knead the dough for three minutes. (将面团揉三分钟。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'nonchalant', '/\'nɒnʃ(ə)l(ə)nt/', '若无其事的, 不关心的, 冷淡的', 'adj', '‘Has he got a girlfriend?’ Jill asked, trying to sound nonchalant. (“他有女朋友吗？”吉尔装出无所谓的样子问道。)', 3),
('en', '托福', 'humanlike', NULL, '似人类的', 'adj', 'In terms of career advice, the most obvious message is: Focus on jobs and areas of expertise that appear to require humanlike general intelligence. (从职业建议上将，最明显的一点是：关注与那些需要人类总体智能的工作或专业领域。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'boron', '/\'bɔːrɒn/', '[化]硼', 'n', 'He said there should be an element under boron. (他认为在，硼的下面也有个元素。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'dump', '/dʌmp/', '倾倒(垃圾), 倾卸；堆存处', 'v', 'We dumped our bags at the nearby Grand Hotel and hurried toward the market. (我们把包扔在附近的格兰德旅馆，急匆匆地向市场赶去。)', 4),
('en', '托福', 'topographically', NULL, '地形地', 'adv', 'Dubai is a part of the Arabian Desert, but is topographically different from it. (迪拜虽然是阿拉伯沙漠的一部分，但从地形上来说，它却不同于阿拉伯沙漠。)', 5),
('en', '托福', 'mandatory', '/\'mændət(ə)rɪ/', '命令的, 托管的', 'adj', 'Murder carries a mandatory life sentence . (谋杀罪依照法律要判无期徒刑。)', 3),
