('en', '托福', 'deter', '/dɪ\'tɜːr/', ' 威慑， 阻止', 'v', 'Supporters of the death penalty argue that it would deter criminals from carrying guns. (死刑的支持者辩称，死刑可以阻止罪犯携带枪支。)', 3),
