('en', 'SAT', 'concede', '/kən\'siːd/', '承认；退让；给予，容许', 'v', '‘That’s the only possible solution.’ ‘Yes, I suppose so,’ Charles conceded. (“那是唯一可行的解决办法。”“对，我想是。”查尔斯承认道。)', 5),
