('en', 'SAT', 'transcription', '/træn\'skrɪpʃ(ə)n; trɑːn-/', '抄写；抄本；誊写', 'n', 'Pronunciation is shown by a system of phonetic transcription. (发音通过一种音标系统标示出来。)', 4),
