('en', 'SAT', 'oxidize', '/\'ɒksɪdaɪz/', '使氧化；使生锈', 'v', 'If the organic material decays or is oxidized, it will not form petroleum. (如果有机物腐烂或氧化，它不会形成石油。)', 5),
('en', 'SAT', 'technique', '/tek\'niːk/', '技巧，技术；手法', 'n', 'He’s a great player, with brilliant technique. (他是个伟大的球员，球技十分精湛。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'reparation', '/,repə\'reɪʃ(ə)n/', '赔偿；修理；赔款', 'n', 'The government agreed to pay reparations to victims. (政府同意向受害者支付赔款。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'misunderstand', '/,mɪsʌndə\'stænd/', '误解；误会', 'v', 'Rachel, you must have misunderstood her! Ellie would never say something like that. (雷切尔，你一定是误会她了！埃莉绝不会说那样的话。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'effusion', '/ɪ\'fjuːʒ(ə)n/', '渗出；泻出；渗漏物', 'n', 'a massive effusion of poisonous gas (毒气的大量逸出)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'scar', '/skɑː/', '伤害；给留下伤痕；创伤；伤痕', 'v', 'His hands were badly scarred by the fire. (他的双手被那次大火烧得疤痕累累。)', 5),
('en', 'SAT', 'affront', '/ə\'frʌnt/', '冒犯，有意冒犯；面对；公开侮辱；轻蔑；公开侮辱', 'v', 'He stepped back, affronted by the question. (他觉得这个问题语带冒犯，退后了几步。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'impulsive', '/ɪm\'pʌlsɪv/', '冲动的；受感情驱使的；任性的', 'adj', 'Rosa was impulsive and sometimes regretted things she’d done. (罗莎性情鲁莽，有时会为做过的事感到后悔。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'indisputable', '/ɪndɪ\'spjuːtəb(ə)l; ɪn\'dɪspjʊtəb(ə)l/', '明白的；无争论之余地的', 'adj', 'It is indisputable that birds are harbouring this illness. (无可争辩的是，鸟类携带着这种疾病。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'blunt', '/blʌnt/', '钝的，不锋利的；生硬的；直率的；使迟钝；(Blunt)人名；(英)布伦特', 'adj', 'Sharpen all your blunt knives. (把你所有的钝刀子都磨一磨。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'condescend', '/kɒndɪ\'send/', '屈尊；俯就；（对某人）表现出优越感', 'v', 'When he condescended to speak, he contradicted himself three or four times in the space of half an hour. (当他屈尊讲话时，半小时内有三四次前后矛盾。)', 3),
('en', 'SAT', 'temperature', '/temprətʃə(r)/', '温度；体温；气温；发烧', 'n', 'The temperature of the water was just right for swimming. (这水温游泳正好。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'beatific', '/biːə\'tɪfɪk/', '幸福的；祝福的；快乐的', 'adj', '...a beatific smile. (...一个幸福的微笑。)', 5),
('en', 'SAT', 'mite', '/maɪt/', '极小量；小虫；小孩儿；微小的东西', 'n', 'Poor mite! You must be starving! (可怜的小家伙！你一定是饿坏了！)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'topography', '/tə\'pɒgrəfɪ/', '地势；地形学；地志', 'n', 'The topography of the river\'s basin has changed significantly since the floods. (洪水过后，这条河的流域地形已经明显改变了。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'liquidate', '/\'lɪkwɪdeɪt/', '清算；偿付；消除', 'v', 'The stock was sold to liquidate the loan. (股票被卖出以偿还贷款。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'veritable', '/\'verɪtəb(ə)l/', '真正的，名副其实的', 'adj', 'The area is a veritable paradise for those who love walking and swimming. (这个地区对于喜欢散步和游泳的人来说简直就是天堂。)', 4);
INSERT IGNORE INTO word_bank (language, category, word, phonetic, translation, part_of_speech, example, difficulty) VALUES
('en', 'SAT', 'hustle', '/\'hʌs(ə)l/', '催促；猛推；强夺；推；奔忙；拥挤喧嚷', 'v', 'The guards hustled Harry out of the car. (卫兵们把哈里从车子里拉了出来。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'pensive', '/\'pensɪv/', '沉思的，忧郁的；悲伤的，哀愁的', 'adj', 'Jan looked pensive. (简神情忧伤。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'comprehensive', '/kɒmprɪ\'hensɪv/', '综合的；广泛的；有理解力的；综合学校；专业综合测验', 'adj', 'We offer our customers a comprehensive range of financial products. (我们为客户提供全面的金融产品。)', 5),
('en', 'SAT', 'solder', '/\'səʊldə; \'sɒldə/', '焊接；焊料；接合物', 'v', 'Fewer workers are needed to solder circuit boards. (焊接电路板需要较少的工人。)', 3),
('en', 'SAT', 'renascent', '/rɪ\'næs(ə)nt; \'neɪ-/', '新生的，复活的；复兴的', 'adj', 'Voters have come back to a renascent Labour Party. (选民又回来支持东山再起的工党了。)', 5),
('en', 'SAT', 'chaos', '/\'keɪɒs/', '混沌，混乱', 'n', 'The country was plunged into economic chaos. (这个国家陷入了经济大混乱。)', 5),
('en', 'SAT', 'hysterical', '/hɪ\'sterɪk(ə)l/', '歇斯底里的；异常兴奋的', 'adj', 'Janet became hysterical and began screaming. (珍妮特歇斯底里起来，开始尖叫。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'aperture', '/\'æpətʃə; -tj(ʊ)ə/', '孔，穴；（照相机，望远镜等的）光圈，孔径；缝隙', 'n', 'Through the aperture he could see daylight. (通过这个孔隙他能看到日光。)', 3),
('en', 'SAT', 'cyclical', '/\'sɪklɪk(ə)l/', '周期的，循环的', 'adj', '...the cyclical nature of the airline business. (…航空业的周期性特征。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'austerity', '/ɒ\'sterɪtɪ; ɔː-/', '紧缩；朴素；苦行；严厉', 'n', 'IMF-backed austerity measures (国际货币基金组织支持的经济紧缩措施)', 5),
('en', 'SAT', 'peddle', '/\'ped(ə)l/', '叫卖；兜售；散播；(Peddle)人名；(英)佩德尔', 'v', 'They were accused of peddling drugs . (他们被控贩卖毒品。)', 3),
('en', 'SAT', 'extant', '/ɪk\'stænt; ek-; \'ekst(ə)nt/', '现存的；显著的', 'adj', 'Few of the manuscripts are still extant. (手稿大都散佚无存。)', 3),
('en', 'SAT', 'sagacity', '/sə\'gæsɪtɪ/', '睿智；聪敏；有远见', 'n', '...a man of great sagacity and immense experience. (...一个极为睿智且经验丰富的男人。)', 5),
('en', 'SAT', 'accompanist', '/ə\'kʌmpənɪst/', '伴奏者；伴随者', 'n', 'In life, everybody has their moments of glory although they may go unnoticed like the accompanist. This does not mean, however, that they are any less important than anyone else. (在生活中，每个人都有着自己光辉的瞬间，虽然他们可能会与伴奏者一样不被人注目，但是，这并不意味着他们的重要程度会比其他人低。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'befuddle', '/bɪ\'fʌd(ə)l/', '使迷惑；使昏沉', 'v', '...problems that are befuddling them. (...使他们困惑的问题。)', 3),
('en', 'SAT', 'resuscitate', '/rɪ\'sʌsɪteɪt/', '使复苏；使复兴', 'v', 'Doctors managed to resuscitate him. (医生把他抢救了过来。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'peccadillo', '/,pekə\'dɪləʊ/', '轻罪；小过失；小瑕疵', 'n', 'The public is willing to forgive him for his peccadillos. (公众愿意原谅他的小过失。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'ascribe', '/ə\'skraɪb/', '归因于；归咎于', 'v', 'An autopsy eventually ascribed the baby\'s death to sudden infant death syndrome. (一次尸检最终把这名婴儿的死亡归因于婴儿猝死综合症。)', 3),
('en', 'SAT', 'bureaucracy', '/,bjʊ(ə)\'rɒkrəsɪ/', '官僚主义；官僚机构；官僚政治', 'n', 'the reduction of unnecessary bureaucracy (消除不必要的官僚体制)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'decrepit', '/dɪ\'krepɪt/', '衰老的；破旧的', 'adj', 'The buildings were in a decrepit state. (这些建筑物破旧不堪。)', 3),
('en', 'SAT', 'nautical', '/\'nɔːtɪk(ə)l/', '航海的，海上的；船员的', 'adj', 'nautical equipment (航海装备)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'arduous', '/\'ɑːdjʊəs/', '努力的；费力的；险峻的', 'adj', NULL, 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'amicable', '/\'æmɪkəb(ə)l/', '友好的；友善的', 'adj', 'Their relationship hasn’t always been amicable. (他们的关系不是一直都很和睦。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'advert', '/\'ædvɜːt/', '注意；谈到；广告', 'v', 'Advertising slots in soaps are expensive to purchase, but guarantee large numbers of viewers seeing the advert. (在肥皂剧中插播广告的费用非常昂贵，但能保证大批观众看到广告。)', 5),
('en', 'SAT', 'capacitor', '/kə\'pæsɪtə/', '[电] 电容器', 'n', 'There is a capacitor in there. (因为里面有一个电容器。)', 4),
