('en', 'SAT', 'enlighten', '/ɪn\'laɪt(ə)n; en-/', '启发，启蒙；教导，开导；照耀', 'v', 'A few dedicated doctors have fought for years to enlighten the profession. (少数富有献身精神的医生为启蒙这一行业而奋斗多年。)', 4),
