('en', 'SAT', 'secretive', '/\'siːkrɪtɪv/', '秘密的；偷偷摸摸的；促进分泌的', 'adj', 'The government has been accused of being secretive and undemocratic. (该政府被指责政务不公开、缺乏民主。)', 4),
