('en', 'SAT', 'olfactory', '/ɒl\'fækt(ə)rɪ/', '嗅觉的；味道的；嗅觉器官', 'adj', 'the olfactory cells in the nose (鼻腔内的嗅觉细胞)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'electrolyte', '/ɪ\'lektrəlaɪt/', '电解液，电解质；电解', 'n', 'That generates electricity and causes the metals to recombine in the electrolyte. (这会产生电流并使金属在电解液中重新合成。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'fabulous', '/\'fæbjʊləs/', '难以置信的；传说的，寓言中的；极好的', 'adj', 'Crystal clear waters, beautiful white sand beaches, swaying palm trees and fabulous dive sites – that’s why the Maldives, is known for being one of the best tropical holiday destinations in the world. (清澈透明的海水，美丽的白色沙滩，摇曳生姿的棕榈树，难以置信的的潜水胜地——这就是马尔代夫被誉为世界上最佳热带地区度假地之一的原因。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'choir', '/\'kwaɪə/', '唱诗班；合唱队；舞蹈队；合唱', 'n', 'He joined a church choir at the age of eight. (他八岁时加入了一个教堂唱诗班。)', 5),
