('en', 'SAT', 'habituate', '/hə\'bitjueit/', ' 使习惯于', 'v', 'Over the centuries, these animals have become habituated to living in a dry environment. (几百年下来，这些动物已经习惯于生活在干燥的环境里。)', 5),
