('en', 'SAT', 'randomly', '/\'rændəmli/', ' 随机地', 'adv', 'In that case: Create a room without name and wait until other players join it randomly. (在这种情况下：创建一个没有名字的房间，等待其他玩家加入随机。)', 4),
