('en', 'SAT', 'audible', '/\'ɔːdəbl/', ' 听得见的', 'adj', 'His voice was barely audible (=  could only just be heard  ) above the roar of the crowd. (人声嘈杂，几乎听不见他的说话声。)', 4),
