('en', 'SAT', 'Anglo-Saxon', '/ˌæŋgləu\'sæksn/', ' 盎格鲁—撒克逊人', 'n', '...the mighty sea power of the Anglo-Saxons. (...盎格鲁撒克逊人的强大海权。)', 3),
