('en', 'SAT', 'reactor', '/ri\'æktə/', ' 核反应堆', 'n', 'Where do you all live? Do you live near a reactor? (你们都住在哪，你们接近一个反应堆吗？)', 3),
('en', 'SAT', 'outcry', '/\'autkrai/', ' 大声疾呼； 强烈抗议', 'n', 'The closure of the local hospital has caused a huge public outcry. (当地医院的关闭激起了大规模的公众抗议。)', 3),
('en', 'SAT', 'penetrate', '/\'penitreit/', ' 穿过； 渗入； 看穿， 洞察', 'v', 'bullets that penetrate thick armour plating (穿过厚装甲的子弹)', 5),
('en', 'SAT', 'reproof', '/ri\'pruːf/', ' 谴责， 非难', 'n', 'She raised her eyebrows in reproof. (她竖起眉毛，面露责备。)', 5),
