('en', 'SAT', 'taunt', '/tɔːnt/', ' 嘲弄， 奚落', 'v', '‘And he’ll believe you, will he?’ Maria taunted. (“他会相信你的，对吧？”玛丽亚嘲讽道。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'devoid', '/di\'vɔid/', ' 全无的， 缺乏的', 'adj', 'I have never looked on a face that was so devoid of feeling. (我从未见过这样一张完全没有感情的脸。)', 4),
