('en', 'SAT', 'dearth', '/dəːθ/', ' 缺乏', 'n', 'EXCEPT as Pearl, in the dearth of human playmates, was thrown more upon the visionary throng which she created. (只不过是由于缺乏玩伴，她同自己创造出来的幻想中的人群更加接近而己。)', 4),
