('en', 'SAT', 'divergent', '/dai\'vəːdʒənt/', ' 分歧的', 'adj', 'Two people who have divergent views on this question are George Watt and Bob Marr. (在这个问题上意见相左的两个人是乔治·瓦特和鲍勃·马尔。)', 4),
