('en', 'SAT', 'projector lens', NULL, '放映机镜头', '', 'The print is un-squeezed by the projector lens which gives the characteristic wide screen (2.35:1) aspect ratio. (放映机的镜头把正片解压缩，并提供符合宽银幕特点的2.35：1比例。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'oratory', '/\'ɔrətəri/', ' 讲演术', 'n', 'He displayed determination as well as powerful oratory. (他既展示了雄辩的演讲术又显示了决心。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'wrest', '/rest/', ' 夺取， 强夺； 歪曲', 'n', NULL, 5),
('en', 'SAT', 'determination', '/diˌtəːmi\'neiʃən/', ' 决心， 果断', 'n', 'his dogged determination (= very strong determination ) to succeed (他想要成功的坚定决心)', 3),
('en', 'SAT', 'discipline', '/\'disiplin/', ' 训练； 锻炼；纪律；学科；规定；训练', 'v', 'Different cultures have different ways of disciplining their children. (不同的文化有不同的管教孩子的方法。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'burnish', '/\'bəːniʃ/', ' 磨光； 擦亮', 'vi', 'The agency hired a New York public-relations firm to burnish Washington\'s image. (该机构雇用了一家纽约公关公司来提升华盛顿的形象。)', 3),
('en', 'SAT', 'calculus', '/\'kælkjuləs/', ' 微积分学； 结石', 'n', 'We have to factor that into the calculus. (我们要在微积分学中考虑这些因素。)', 5),
('en', 'SAT', 'ensconce', '/in\'skɔns/', ' 使隐藏； 安置', 'v', 'ensconced in a chair ()', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'proclamation', '/ˌprɔklə\'meiʃən/', ' 宣布', 'n', 'The authorities issued a proclamation forbidding public meetings. (当局发布了公告，禁止公开集会。)', 5),
('en', 'SAT', 'valediction', '/ˌvæli\'dikʃən/', ' 告别； 告别词', 'n', NULL, 3),
('en', 'SAT', 'suspension', '/sə\'spenʃən/', ' 吊； 悬浮； 悬浮液； 暂停， 中止； 悬而未决， 延迟', 'n', 'He received a six-month suspension for unprofessional behaviour. (他因有违职业道德的行为被停职六个月。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'inevitable', '/in\'evitəbl/', ' 不可避免的， 必然发生的', 'adj', 'A further escalation of the crisis now seems inevitable. (危机的进一步升级现在看来已不可避免。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'relapse', '/ri\'læps/', ' 旧病复发', 'v', '"I wish I did," said Phil Jordan, relapsing into his usual gloom. (“我要是做了就好了，”菲尔•乔丹说着，回到平时的忧郁中。)', 3),
('en', 'SAT', 'antecede', '/ˌænti\'siːd/', ' 先前， 先行', 'v', NULL, 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'insensible', '/in\'sensəbl/', ' 失去知觉的； 麻木不仁的； 无感觉的', 'adj', 'He fell to the ground, insensible. (他跌倒在地，失去了知觉。)', 3),
('en', 'SAT', 'vaccinate', '/\'væksineit/', ' 进行预防接种', 'v', 'Dogs must be vaccinated against distemper. (犬类必须接种疫苗以防犬热病。)', 4),
