('en', 'SAT', 'sear', '/siə/', ' 烤焦， 使枯萎', 'v', 'Grass fires have seared the land near the farming village of Basekhai. (草地野火烧焦了巴斯克亥农庄附近的土地。)', 3),
('en', 'SAT', 'disingenuous', '/ˌdisin\'dʒenjuəs/', ' 不真诚的， 无诚意的', 'adj', 'Keeping the details of the tax changes vague is disingenuous. (对税收变革的细节含糊其词并不光明正大。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'placenta', '/plə\'sentə/', ' 胎盘', 'n', 'The drug can be transferred to the baby via the placenta. (该药会通过胎盘传给胎儿。)', 5),
('en', 'SAT', 'bridge', '/bridʒ/', '桥； 架桥； 渡过', 'n', 'He walked back over the railway bridge. (他从铁路桥上走了回去。)', 3),
('en', 'SAT', 'evaporation', '/iˌvæpə\'reiʃən/', ' 蒸发', 'n', 'At this state condensation and evaporation are at an equilibrium and take place at the same rate. (在这种状态时水的凝结和蒸发达到平衡状态并且以相同的速度进行。)', 3),
