('en', 'SAT', 'minus', '/\'mainəs/', ' 表示减  的， 负的； 阴性的；减，除', 'adj', 'The aircraft was subjected to temperatures of minus 65 degrees and plus 120 degrees. (该飞机经受了零下65 度和零上120度的温度。)', 4),
