('en', 'SAT', 'torque', '/tɔːk/', ' 扭矩', 'n', 'To preserve the same twist, the torque should also be the same. (为保持相当的扭转，扭矩也应该具有相同的比例。)', 3),
('en', 'SAT', 'dais', '/\'deiis/', ' 台， 讲台', 'n', 'There is a female vice premier, she add colour to our dais today. (其中有一位女性副总理，她为我们今天的讲台增加了一点鲜艳的色彩。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'workmanlike', '/\'wəːkmənlaik/', ' 精巧的， 技巧熟练的', 'adj', 'The team put up a good workmanlike performance to win 1-0. (该队技术娴熟，表现卖力，以一比零获胜。)', 3),
