('en', 'SAT', 'irate', '/ai\'reit/', ' 生气的， 发怒的', 'adj', 'The owner was so irate he almost threw me out of the place. (主人那么生气，他差点儿把我从那个地方赶出去。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'impression', '/im\'preʃən/', ' 印象， 感想； 盖印， 压痕', 'n', 'When we looked around the school we got a very good impression. (我们参观了学校，对它的印象很好。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'inequity', '/in\'ekwəti/', ' 不公平， 不公正', 'n', 'Social imbalance worries him more than inequity of income. (社会失衡比收入不公平更令他担忧。)', 5),
('en', 'SAT', 'appease', '/ə\'piːz/', ' 平息； 安抚， 缓和； 满足', 'vt', 'They attempted to appease international opposition by promising to hold talks. (他们答应举行会谈，试图以此平息国际上的反对声音。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'impede', '/im\'piːd/', ' 妨碍， 阻碍， 阻止', 'v', 'Storms at sea impeded our progress. (海上风暴阻碍了我们的航程。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'volitive', '/\'vɔlətiv/', ' 意志的， 表示祈望或准许的', 'adj', NULL, 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'pepsin', '/\'pepsin/', ' 胃蛋白酶', 'n', 'METHODS: Retinal vascular preparations were performed by using trypsin digestion and pepsin-trypsin digestion technique respectively. (方法：分别用胰蛋白酶消化法及胃蛋白酶-胰蛋白酶联合消化法制备视网膜血管铺片，比较铺片成功率。)', 3),
('en', 'SAT', 'shield', '/ʃiːld/', ' 保护， 防护， 遮蔽； 防护物， 护罩， 盾， 盾状物', 'v', 'Women will often lie to shield even the most abusive partner. (哪怕是再暴力的伴侣，女性也往往会撒谎保护他。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'statuesque', '/ˌstætʃu\'esk/', ' 雕像般的； 庄严而优雅的', 'adj', 'a statuesque woman (一位端庄优雅的高挑女子)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'anatomy', '/ə\'nætəmi/', ' 解剖学； 解剖结构', 'n', 'a professor of anatomy (解剖学教授)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'gratuity', '/grə\'tjuːiti/', ' 赠物， 赏钱', 'n', NULL, 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'credo', '/\'kriːdəu/', ' 信条', 'n', 'American Express is emphasizing its ‘the customer is first’ credo. (美国运通公司强调其“客户至上”的信条。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'instantaneous', '/ˌinstən\'teinjəs/', ' 瞬间的， 即刻的', 'adj', 'modern methods of instantaneous communication (现代的即时通信方法)', 5),
('en', 'SAT', 'phenomenon', '/fi\'nɔminən/', '现象', 'n', 'Homelessness is not a new phenomenon . (无家可归已不是什么新现象。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'writhe', '/raið/', ' 扭曲， 扭歪； 翻腾', 'v', 'He was writhing in agony. (他痛得直打滚。)', 3),
('en', 'SAT', 'quarterly', '/\'kwɔːtəli/', '每季一次；每季的； 季刊', 'adv', 'It makes no difference whether dividends are paid quarterly or annually. (红利是按季度还是按年度支付没有区别。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'zephyr', '/\'zefə/', ' 西风； 微风', 'n', 'There was silence now except for the distant sea, a slight zephyr stirring the trees. (现在，除了遥远的海浪以外，一片寂静，一阵微风摇曳着树林。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'alienable', '/\'eiljənəbl/', ' 可让与的', 'adj', 'At common law, the right of re - entry is not alienable, assignable, or devisable. (普通法上， 收回权是不可流转、 转让或遗赠的。)', 5),
('en', 'SAT', 'abbey', '/\'æbi/', ' 大修道院； 大教堂', 'n', NULL, 3),
('en', 'SAT', 'sensibility', '/ˌsensə\'biləti/', ' 敏感性', 'n', 'her religious sensibilities (她的宗教感情)', 5),
('en', 'SAT', 'bibliography', '/ˌbibli\'ɔgrəfi/', '  书目； 参考书目', 'n', 'At the end of this chapter there is a select bibliography of useful books. (本章末尾附着有用书籍的精选书目。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'buoyant', '/\'bɔiənt/', ' 有浮力的； 轻快的', 'adj', 'Cork is very buoyant. (软木浮性很好。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'chloroplast', '/\'klɔːrəplæst/', ' 叶绿体', 'n', 'In C4 plants there are two types of chloroplast. (在C4植物中有两种类型的叶绿体。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'intrepid', '/in\'trepid/', ' 无畏的； 勇猛的', 'adj', 'intrepid explorers (勇敢的探险家)', 5),
('en', 'SAT', 'travail', '/\'træveil/', ' 辛苦； 苦役； 工作', 'n', 'The team, despite their recent travails, are still in the game. (这支运动队，尽管近来遇到了难题，但还没有出局。)', 5),
('en', 'SAT', 'dullard', '/\'dʌləd/', ' 傻瓜', 'n', NULL, 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'generalize', '/\'dʒenərəlaiz/', ' 推广', 'v', 'Can we generalise this principle? (这个原理可以推而广之吗？)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'accredit', '/ə\'kredit/', ' 信任', 'v', 'Only such, we just can win the accredit of people and support, win common feelings of people. (只有这样，我们才能赢得人民群众的信任和支持，赢得民心。)', 3),
('en', 'SAT', 'condenser', '/kən\'densə/', ' 冷凝器', 'n', 'Replace the refrigerant line between the compressor and condenser. (更换压缩机与冷凝器之间的制冷剂管路。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'paradoxical', '/ˌpærə\'dɔksikəl/', ' 似非而是的； 自相矛盾的', 'adj', 'Some sedatives produce the paradoxical effect of making the person more anxious. (一些镇静剂产生出使人更紧张这样自相矛盾的结果。)', 5),
('en', 'SAT', 'dissever', '/dis\'sevə/', ' 割裂； 分开', 'v', NULL, 5),
('en', 'SAT', 'postdate', '/ˌpəust\'deit/', ' 推迟…的日期', 'v', 'He send us a postdate cheque. (他寄给我们一张填迟日期的支票。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'subdue', '/səb\'djuː/', ' 征服； 抑制', 'v', 'Police managed to subdue the angry crowd. (警察设法控制住了愤怒的人群。)', 5),
