('en', 'SAT', 'swift', '/swift/', ' 快速的， 敏捷的', 'adj', 'My letter received a swift reply. (我的信很快就得到了回复。)', 3),
('en', 'SAT', 'ductile', '/\'dʌktail/', ' 易延展的； 易教导的', 'adj', 'In turn, this prevents issues concerning corrosion, as the ductile material doesn\'t crack. (因此，这也避免了一些腐蚀性问题，比如一些可延展的材料不易开裂。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'add', '/æd/', ' 加', 'v', 'If the mixture seems dry, add water. (如果混合物看上去干，加点水。)', 4),
