('en', 'SAT', 'nullify', '/\'nʌlifai/', ' 使无效', 'v', 'The election results were nullified because of voter fraud. (由于选票造假，选举结果被宣布无效。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'benevolent', '/bə\'nevələnt/', ' 慈善的', 'adj', 'A benevolent uncle paid for her to have music lessons. (一位叔叔慷慨解囊，出钱供她上音乐课。)', 4),
