('en', 'SAT', 'reproductive system', NULL, '[解剖] 生殖系统；繁殖方式', '', 'Reduce Stress. Stress affects all body systems, including your reproductive system. (减压。压力影响所有身体器官，包括你的生殖系统。)', 4),
