('en', 'SAT', 'benevolence', '/bə\'nevələns/', ' 仁爱心； 善行', 'n', NULL, 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'disinfect', '/ˌdisin\'fekt/', ' 消毒', 'v', 'First use some iodine to disinfect the wound. (先用碘酒给伤口消毒。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'expiate', '/\'ekspieit/', ' 赎罪； 补偿', 'v', 'It seemed that Alice was expiating her father\'s sins with her charity work. (看来爱丽丝要用自己的善行来赎她父亲的罪恶。)', 5),
