('en', 'SAT', 'eject', '/i\'dʒekt/', ' 喷射， 排出； 驱逐', 'v', 'Two engines cut out and the plane started to eject fuel as it lost height. (两个发动机突然熄火，飞机在下降的同时开始喷出燃料。)', 3),
