('en', 'SAT', 'odds', '/ɔdz/', ' 事物发生的可能性， 机会', 'n', '(= it is likely ) that he will commit the same crime again. (他可能还会犯同样的罪行。)', 3),
('en', 'SAT', 'acme', '/\'ækmi/', ' 顶点， 顶端', 'n', 'the acme of perfection (尽善尽美)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'casual', '/\'kæʒjuəl/', ' 偶然的； 临时的', 'adj', 'casual labour (临时工)', 4),
