('en', 'SAT', 'digit', '/\'didʒit/', ' 数字，  数', 'n', 'Her telephone number differs from mine by one digit. (她的电话号码跟我的差一个数字。)', 5),
('en', 'SAT', 'disadvantage', '/ˌdisəd\'vɑːntidʒ/', ' 不便， 不利， 不利的情况；  损害， 损失', 'n', 'His two main rivals suffer the disadvantage of having been long-term political exiles. (他的两名主要竞争对手由于长期被政治流放而处于不利地位。)', 3),
('en', 'SAT', 'suspicious', '/sə\'spiʃəs/', ' 可疑的， 令人怀疑的', 'adj', 'His reluctance to answer my questions made me suspicious . (他不愿回答我的问题，这引起我的怀疑。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'zeal', '/ziːl/', ' 热心， 热情', 'n', '...his zeal for teaching. (…他对教学的热衷。)', 4),
