('en', 'SAT', 'epitaph', '/\'epitɑːf/', ' 墓志铭， 碑文', 'n', 'He wanted these lines as his epitaph. (他想把这些文字作为他的墓志铭。)', 5),
('en', 'SAT', 'renovate', '/\'renəuveit/', ' 革新； 刷新， 修复', 'v', 'The hotel has been renovated and redecorated. (酒店已经翻新，并重新装饰。)', 5),
('en', 'SAT', 'crepuscular', '/kri\'pʌskjulə/', ' 朦胧的； 拂晓的； 黄昏的', 'adj', '...peering through the crepuscular gloom. (...透过昏暗的暮色凝视。)', 5),
