('en', 'SAT', 'atheism', '/\'eiθiizəm/', ' 无神论', 'n', 'Despite the title, her latest book is not so much a case for God as a case against atheism. (尽管书名如此，但她最新的这本书做为反对无神论的案例并不一定是上帝要学的课程。)', 3),
('en', 'SAT', 'cornea', '/\'kɔːniə/', ' 角膜', 'n', 'They accommodate by greatly changing the curvature of the cornea. (它们由大大地改变角膜曲率的方法来调节。)', 4),
('en', 'SAT', 'odoriferous', '/ˌəudə\'rifərəs/', ' 有香气的', 'adj', 'The odoriferous spices stimulated her jaded appetite. (香料的芬芳刺激她疲惫的胃口。)', 5),
